description:
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: This position is hybrid in London, United Kingdom.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires travel across EMEA, including the client meetings, industry events, and relationship-building activities that support enterprise growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Huge is accelerating its growth across EMEA and is looking for a growth leader who can turn market opportunities and senior relationships into new business. You’ll identify where Huge can win, build relationships with enterprise decision-makers, originate qualified opportunities, and lead pursuits from first conversation through close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Huge’s Global Growth team, Marketing and Communications, Alliances, senior client partners, and practice leaders to build pipeline and convert it into revenue.&amp;nbsp;Success is measured by qualified pipeline generated, new business won, and revenue closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate new business.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a prioritized EMEA target account strategy, using Huge’s ideal client profile, market signals, and buying triggers to focus on the opportunities most likely to convert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Originate opportunities through direct outreach, senior relationships, referrals, industry events, and partner channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with CMOs, CDOs, CTOs, and other decision-makers to uncover business challenges before they become formal briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities early, establishing business need, access to decision-makers, budget, timing, and a credible path to winning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn conversations into defined next steps and qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build relationships and active channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong network of enterprise buyers, agency search consultants, advisors, former clients, and referral sources across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Huge’s Alliances team to develop joint opportunities and co-sell with strategic technology partners, including Adobe, Google Cloud, Contentful, Optimizely, Shopify, and Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activate Huge’s existing relationships and partner ecosystem to create warm introductions and access to priority accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Marketing and Communications to turn campaigns, thought leadership, and events into relevant reasons to engage target buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead pursuits and close deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial strategy for opportunities you originate, from qualification and pursuit planning through proposal, negotiation, and signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a compelling &lt;em&gt;why Huge, why now&lt;/em&gt; narrative grounded in the client’s business priorities, market context, and buying triggers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together the right leaders across strategy, experience, technology, data, and creative to build a differentiated, competitive proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align client partners and delivery leaders around the solution, scope, value proposition, and commercial model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain pursuit momentum, manage risks, and make clear decisions about where to invest time and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth Operations to maintain accurate CRM data, pipeline forecasts, and performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect market insight to growth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align outbound priorities with account-based marketing, event strategy, and alliance partner plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Huge’s capabilities across brand, experience, product, technology, data, and AI into relevant business outcomes for specific buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market intelligence back to the organization, including emerging client needs, competitive dynamics, objections, and messages that resonate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help refine Huge’s regional go-to-market strategy based on what you learn from buyers and the opportunities you pursue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’d like to see.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in enterprise business development, new business, or growth at an agency, consultancy, or professional services firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated record of originating and closing six- and seven-figure enterprise engagements across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established network of senior marketing, digital, technology, or business leaders in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling complex services spanning digital transformation, customer experience, brand, marketing, technology, or related disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agency search consultants, competitive pitches, and enterprise procurement processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-enabled, data-led, or platform-based services is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Huge.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Huge is an independent, human-first AI-native design and technology company. We make things that matter by bringing AI, people, design and technology together as one system. With more than 1,000 design and technology experts working in hub cities around the world, including Bogotá, Chicago, Ho Chi Minh City, London, Los Angeles, Medellín, New York, San Francisco, and Washington, DC, we partner with some of the world’s most ambitious brands, including Google, NBCU, PepsiCo, Vail Resorts, Atlantic Health, and Candescent. Learn more at&lt;a href=&quot;http://hugeinc.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; hugeinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Huge is committed to creating an inclusive employee experience for all. Regardless of race, gender, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, or if you’re parenting the next generation of innovators, we firmly believe that our work is at its best when everyone feels free to be their most authentic self.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Huge is an equal opportunity employer (EOE). We strongly support diversity in the workforce. We are committed to an inclusive, barrier-free recruitment and selection process and work environment. If you are contacted for a job opportunity, please advise us of any accommodation needed to ensure you have access to a fair and equitable process. Any information received relating to accommodation will be addressed confidentially.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Workers shall not be required to pay employers’ or agents’ recruitment fees or other related fees for their employment. If any such fees are found to have been paid by workers, such fees shall be repaid to the worker.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;#LI-POST #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a global team of innovators and pioneers dedicated to shaping the future of observability. At New Relic, we build an intelligent platform that empowers companies to thrive in an AI-first world by giving them unparalleled insight into their complex systems. As we continue to expand our global footprint, we&#39;re looking for passionate people to join our mission. If you&#39;re ready to help the world&#39;s best companies optimize their digital applications, we invite you to explore a career with us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_9a2fd7fcfa95277b&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Your Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;Are you looking to take your enterprise sales or alliance management career to the next level by driving growth for one of the industry&#39;s most critical cloud channels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;? At New Relic, we believe in the power of data to create better software and exceptional digital experiences and our cloud partners are right at the heart of how we scale that vision globally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot;&gt;As our &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Senior Cloud Partner Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you won&#39;t just be managing partnerships; you will act as a pivotal growth engine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2&quot;&gt;. You will bridge the gap between our internal sales leadership and our cloud partner counterparts at Amazon Web Services (AWS) and Microsoft Azure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4&quot;&gt;. If you want the autonomy to build deep network relationships, align go-to-market strategies, and accelerate high-velocity co-sell motions that directly influence pipeline revenue, this is the place to do it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6&quot;&gt;. You&#39;ll join a collaborative, inclusive environment where data-driven ideas win, giving you the space to innovate and elevate your professional profile alongside top industry talent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Strategy &amp;amp; Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the strategic bridge between New Relic’s sales leaders (AVPs, RVPs, and Account Executives) and AWS/Azure partner sales teams to ensure seamless collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execute Co-Sell Motions:&lt;/strong&gt; Map accounts, identify new logos, and accelerate deal cycles by leveraging AWS Marketplace and Azure Marketplace (CPPO/MPO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Generate Qualified Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Build regional partner plans that fuel business growth, making full use of cloud provider funding programs, incentives, and consumption credits (EDPs/MACC)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build &amp;amp; Evangelise Cloud Networks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate deep, trusted relationships with Partner Development Managers (PDMs), Cloud Account Managers, and field leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,2&quot;&gt;. Educate partner teams so New Relic remains top-of-mind for cloud migration and observability initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Governance &amp;amp; QBRs:&lt;/strong&gt; Own Quarterly Business Reviews with internal and external stakeholders to track performance, celebrate wins, and ensure long-term pipeline health&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;This Role Requires&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ecosystem Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Substantial background in successfully managing AWS or Microsoft Azure partnerships within an Enterprise Software, SaaS, or Alliance Management environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Co-Sell Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of navigating cloud provider field structures, co-sell programs, and cloud marketplace mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sales Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong familiarity with complex enterprise sales cycles and a demonstrated ability to partner effectively with Enterprise Account Executives to close deals faster&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication skills with a proven ability to influence, align, and inspire cross-functional teams and external stakeholders without relying on direct authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Simultaneous, hands-on experience managing &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot;&gt;both&lt;/strong&gt; AWS and Azure co-sell ecosystems at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Practical familiarity with observability, application performance monitoring (APM), or cloud infrastructure operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Existing networks and active relationships with AWS or Microsoft Partner Development Managers (PDMs) and regional sales teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote #LI-JJ2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fostering a diverse, welcoming and inclusive environment is important to us. We work hard to make everyone feel comfortable bringing their best, most authentic selves to work every day. We celebrate our talented Relics’ different backgrounds and abilities, and recognize the different paths they took to reach us – including nontraditional ones. Their experiences and perspectives inspire us to make our products and company the best they can be. We’re looking for people who feel connected to our mission and values, not just candidates who check off all the boxes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application or recruiting process, please reach out to &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering all Relics to achieve professional and business success through a flexible workforce model. This model allows us to work in a variety of workplaces that best support our success, including fully office-based, fully remote, or hybrid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work and to complete employment eligibility verification. Note: Our stewardship of the data of thousands of customers means that a criminal background check is required to join New Relic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We will consider qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records based on individual circumstances and in accordance with applicable law including, but not limited to, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. New Relic does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes, and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic develops and distributes encryption software and technology that complies with U.S. export controls and licensing requirements. Certain New Relic roles require candidates to pass an export compliance assessment as a condition of employment in any global location. If relevant, we will provide more information later in the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates are evaluated based on qualifications, regardless of race, religion, ethnicity, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, age, disability, neurodiversity, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review our Applicant Privacy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;WHAT MAKES US EPIC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Epic’s success are talented, passionate people. Epic prides itself on creating a collaborative, welcoming, and creative environment. Whether it’s building award-winning games or crafting engine technology that enables others to make visually stunning interactive experiences, we’re always innovating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being Epic means being a part of a team that continually strives to do right by our community and users. We’re constantly innovating to raise the bar of engine and game development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;PROGRAMMING - UNREAL ENGINE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unreal-powered projects have been on the bleeding edge of real-time entertainment for over 20 years. Our team of programming experts are always innovating to improve the tools and technology that empower content developers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games is seeking an experienced Senior Language Programmer to join our Verse team, which owns the toolchain (compiler, VM, and runtime) that powers game development in Unreal Engine and UEFN. You&#39;ll work on the systems every UE and UEFN developer relies on to build and ship games with Verse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend, evolve, and maintain the Verse compiler toolchain, transactional memory runtime and VM, add new platform support, implement new language features and integrate with Unreal Engine&#39;s content, build, and cooking pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize performance, memory usage, and iteration times across the Verse toolchain, runtime and UE/Verse boundary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with language consumers to ensure an exceptional user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish test workflows to validate improvements and prevent regressions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain the scripting interface to Unreal Engine, working in close collaboration with the Verse Language team and the broader UE engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of C++17 or later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in compiler or toolchain development (e.g., compiler internals, VM design, Clang/LLVM, or linker/platform ABI specifics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and optimizing large codebases, with the ability to make tradeoffs between usability, performance, and power&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to reason about large, interconnected systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in software engineering principles, including API design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work autonomously and deliver practical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Unreal Engine integration is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;EPIC JOB + EPIC BENEFITS = EPIC LIFE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intent is to cover all things that are medically necessary and improve the quality of life. We pay 100% of the premiums for both you and your dependents. Our coverage includes Medical, Dental, a Vision HRA, Long Term Disability, Life Insurance &amp;amp; a 401k with competitive match. We also offer a robust mental well-being program through Modern Health, which provides free therapy and coaching for employees &amp;amp; dependents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout the year we celebrate our employees with events and company-wide paid breaks. We offer unlimited PTO and sick time and recognize individuals for 7 years of employment with a paid sabbatical.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games​ ​is a leading interactive entertainment company. For over 30 years we&#39;ve been making award-winning games and engine technology that empowers others to make visually stunning games and 3D content that bring environments to life like never before. Epic&#39;s award-winning Unreal Engine technology not only provides game developers the ability to build high-fidelity, interactive experiences for PC, console, mobile, and VR, it is also a tool being embraced by content creators across a variety of industries such as media and entertainment, automotive, and architectural design. As we continue to build our Engine technology and develop remarkable games, we strive to build teams of world-class talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Like what you hear? Come be a part of something Epic!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epic Games deeply values diverse teams and an inclusive work culture, and we are proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer. Learn more about our Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/eeo-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note to Recruitment Agencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Epic does not accept any unsolicited resumes or approaches from any unauthorized third party (including recruitment or placement agencies) (i.e., a third party with whom we do not have a negotiated and validly executed agreement). We will not pay any fees to any unauthorized third party. Further details on these matters can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epicgames.com/note-to-recruitment-agencies&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a collaborative, self-motivated &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Search &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you’ll help build and evolve the customer-facing search experiences that help users discover relevant, high-quality content, along with the backend systems that power them. You’ll work across the stack, with a slight emphasis on frontend development, and collaborate closely with engineers, Product, and Design to deliver intuitive search experiences backed by reliable, scalable search and data systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver customer-facing search features and workflows across frontend and backend systems, from technical planning through production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered product experiences end to end, from the services behind them to the interfaces that make their output useful and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build intuitive, responsive user experiences using Vue while contributing to the Python and Django services that power them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve search, indexing, and retrieval systems that support high-quality content discovery across large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain features and data workflows that leverage technologies such as Elasticsearch, Kafka, Celery, and MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful technical decisions and trade-offs that balance customer experience, delivery speed, performance, reliability, and long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, and engineering teammates to shape solutions, clarify requirements, and deliver high-quality customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex production issues and drive improvements to the performance, reliability, observability, and maintainability of the systems you work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call and incident response rotation, helping diagnose and resolve production issues and improve system reliability over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working across frontend and backend systems and independently delivering features throughout the application stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Python or a similar programming language and experience with Django or a comparable web framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building polished, maintainable user-facing applications with Vue.js or another modern JavaScript framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Elasticsearch or a comparable search technology, or significant experience working with data-intensive systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience making technical trade-offs within complex production systems while balancing immediate delivery needs with long-term quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience diagnosing production issues and contributing to the reliability and operational health of the systems you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TypeScript in a large codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design systems or shared component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adjust working hours for overlap with teammates in US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or other streaming or event-driven technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MySQL, Postgres, or other relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Celery or other asynchronous task-processing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building search, discovery, indexing, or information-retrieval features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving frontend architecture, performance, or complex customer-facing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-traffic SaaS applications or systems that process large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer-facing features backed by LLMs or other AI models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience judging whether an AI-backed feature is actually working, through evaluation, testing, or user feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in journalism, news, media, or social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Addition, We&#39;re Always Looking for Candidates Who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex technical ideas clearly and collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of problems and drive work forward independently while knowing when to involve others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in building readable, testable, maintainable software while making pragmatic technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach ambiguous or complex problems thoughtfully and use sound judgment to identify effective solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a strong engineering culture through thoughtful code reviews, knowledge sharing, feedback, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively incorporates AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,000+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work, Forever&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully distributed team with a permanent remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend, phone and internet reimbursement, coworking membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-person team bonding (lunches, events, competitions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent &amp;amp; Fair Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive geo-neutral pay in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual reviews to ensure equity and market alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardized bonus or commission structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, disability, and life insurance for employees and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% premium coverage for individuals on high-deductible plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Virtual Care and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-funded HSA contributions and other pre-tax benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly wellness stipend and free Headspace subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4+ weeks of PTO, plus paid sick and mental health days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13 paid holidays with the option to swap for personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pathways for internal mobility and promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual performance reviews, team workshops, and leadership training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited access to Coursera and O’Reilly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 additional PTO days annually for learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive, Customer-First Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to equity and valuing diverse perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, founder-led company focused on collaboration and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by 3,000+ companies worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Benefits and compensation reflect offerings for U.S.-based employees. Support is provided for employees in other locations, in compliance with local laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we are a fully distributed team, we do have limitations on where we can hire and maintain a list of acceptable working locations based on job function. If we are unable to hire in your current location for the role for which you applied, you will be notified via email. While we enjoy many benefits as a permanently distributed and remote company, we cannot always support relocation or extended travel and have guidelines in place to ensure compliant work away from your designated permanent residence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter__right&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;Please note: For detailed information regarding our GDPR and/or CCPA compliance policies, including how we handle personal data and privacy rights, kindly refer to the email correspondence accompanying this application.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Muck Rack does not accept unsolicited resumes from search firms or any other third parties. Any unsolicited resume sent to Muck Rack will be considered Muck Rack property, and Muck Rack will not pay a fee should it hire the subject of any unsolicited resume.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Muck Rack considers applicants for all positions on the basis of merit, qualifications, and business needs, and without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, age, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, alienage or citizenship status, ancestry, marital status, genetic predisposition or carrier status, veteran status, familial status, status as a victim of domestic violence, or any other status or characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;Note to applicants/job seekers: We have recently been made aware of scams impersonating Muck Rack’s HR team. Please be cautious of these attempts to elicit banking or other financial or sensitive information. Muck Rack will never request financial information during the interview process, and follow ups for interviews or next steps will always come from an ----- email address. If you are contacted by anyone from a different domain who claims to be from Muck Rack, please forward the communication to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- -----
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
