&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SQL or NoSQL data stores, queue services, cache services, and/or gateway services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You follow the latest in software engineering and open source technologies, and can intuit the fine line between promising new practice and overhyped fad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love delighting end users and hunger for novel challenges&lt;/li&gt;
