&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€53.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€71.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is a fortress in a volatile market. We are a $1.9B ARR, NYSE-listed powerhouse that sells essential technology to the physical operations powering the global economy. This is a seat built for high performers and incredibly driven individuals who want to accelerate their careers — the bar for entry is high, but those who execute are well rewarded for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While the rest of the tech scene is scaling back, our France team continued to perform above 100% last year. We are looking for territory owners who want to manage deal cycles from €&lt;strong&gt;20k to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;€&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;200k&lt;/strong&gt;, selling a complex suite of 15+ products to 8 different personas, including MDs and Finance Directors. If you want to be pushed to your limit and rewarded with the stability of a market leader, this is the place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whilst the role can be worked remotely anywhere in France, there is a need to visit clients in the region as required (typically fortnightly basis).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world&lt;/strong&gt;: Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your mantra is &lt;strong&gt;#alwaysbeprospecting&lt;/strong&gt;: The world of operations is vast. Your customers are often out in the field and the best way to catch them is live on the phone. Samsara’s top reps do constant research to find companies and contacts to expand their pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have innate curiosity in how businesses work&lt;/strong&gt;: One day you’ll meet with someone in waste management and the next you may be learning about the inner workings of a food distribution center. Our top sales team members seek to learn the ins and outs of the businesses they support in order to make a larger impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a life-long learner&lt;/strong&gt;: Samsara sales are complex. You will need to learn about businesses where you previously had little knowledge. The payoff is big but you have to be willing to put in the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build genuine relationships with your customers&lt;/strong&gt;: The industries we serve have relied on pen-and-paper solutions for years and haven’t been met with the type of technology we offer. Our customers value earned trust and human relationships built over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; Samsara’s high-performance Sales culture means you’ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go farther than you have before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your destiny:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate as a pure revenue leader, responsible for &lt;strong&gt;80-90% net-new logo acquisition&lt;/strong&gt; through self-sourced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get In Early: &lt;/strong&gt;The France Mid-Market is a high-achieving segment in the company. The window to build something significant is open right now.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharpen Your Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Access elite enablement — Command the Message and MEDDPICC coaching — built to make you a more effective closer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate Complexity:&lt;/strong&gt; Move beyond feature-pushing to sell high-level ROI and safety outcomes to sophisticated economic buyers (MDs and FDs) in the field and the boardroom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Winning DNA:&lt;/strong&gt; A minimum of 18 months in a full-cycle, outbound-heavy SaaS closing role. You must have a proven history of building your own pipe from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verified Overachievement:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of hitting and exceeding quota in a competitive, complex environment. We’ll want to see this on your resume.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Grit:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing multi-stakeholder deal cycles and technical POCs. We value your ability to hunt more than the brand name on your previous CV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native French&lt;/strong&gt; language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also offers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; You are eager to learn the inner workings of diverse industries, from waste management to food distribution, to better align our technology with their operational pain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Repeatable Sales Framework:&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t rely on luck or intuition. You have a structured methodology that delivers success and you understand that consistent, high-quality inputs lead to predictable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Data-Minded Approach:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a student of your own funnel. You understand how to structure your activity—prospecting volume, discovery depth, and multi-threading—to ensure a consistent output and forecast accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Process Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a relentless drive for self-improvement. You are someone who actively seeks feedback, iterates on their approach, and understands that evolving your tactics is the only way to stay ahead of the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pallet &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is building AI Agents to transform the physical economy, a $12 trillion global TAM. We’ve raised $50M from top investors, including General Catalyst, Bessemer Venture Partners, and Bain Capital Ventures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to increase the efficiency of the global supply chain by automating the manual workflows that slow supply chain teams down. Our flagship platform provides end-to-end visibility, and control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As companies across the physical economy look to drive efficiency, many are turning to Pallet to lead the way. With deep supply chain expertise and cutting-edge AI capabilities, we’re positioned to build the next $10B company powering the physical economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and work alongside leaders from Google, DoorDash, YC, and more to shape the future of supply chain technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote from Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be an Enterprise Account Executive anywhere. Why us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a well-funded, high-growth startup on a clear path to $100M ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell a category-defining AI Agents platform with massive surface area across logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Pallet’s presence across Europe as one of the first commercial hires on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with founders and senior leadership to define our international go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help transform one of the world’s largest industries while building toward a $10B+ outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring our first Founding Enterprise Account Executives in EMEA to build Pallet’s commercial presence across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own net-new enterprise acquisition across the region, build relationships with the largest logistics providers in Europe, and help establish the playbook for our international expansion. This is a highly consultative enterprise sales role focused on educating customers on an entirely new category of AI-powered workflow automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Solutions, and Customer Success to drive a solution-selling motion centered around workflow discovery, AI use case identification, structured pilots, and measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote from Switzerland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full enterprise sales cycle across EMEA, from outbound prospecting through contract signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a 3x-4x qualified pipeline through disciplined outbound execution while self-sourcing at least 30% of opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders across Europe’s largest logistics providers, including COO, CIO, VP Operations, VP Supply Chain, and VP Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative discovery sessions that map operational workflows to Pallet’s AI agent capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and lead structured pilots that demonstrate measurable operational ROI and convert into enterprise deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive business cases that align operational improvements with financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document repeatable customer use cases and market feedback to shape Pallet’s product roadmap and international GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish Pallet as the leading AI platform for enterprise logistics across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise B2B SaaS or enterprise logistics sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German: you can run discovery, negotiate and present to executives in German.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently closing six- and seven-figure enterprise software agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative selling and value-based sales methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex buying committees and long enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with senior operators and technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable selling technical, workflow-heavy software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand complex logistics operations and translate them into compelling AI automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent outbound prospecting and territory-building discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling into logistics, supply chain, transportation, or warehouse operations is strongly preferred but not required. Candidates without logistics experience should demonstrate an ability to quickly learn operational workflows and become trusted advisors to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working hours are generally &lt;strong&gt;9:00am-6:00pm London time&lt;/strong&gt;, providing full coverage of the European business day while maintaining regular collaboration with our San Francisco headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll typically spend:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mornings and early afternoons working directly with European customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Late afternoons collaborating with our US-based Sales, Product, and Engineering teams during our daily overlap window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 65% of your time traveling across Europe for customer meetings, executive workshops, pilots, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report directly to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;VP of Global Revenue&lt;/strong&gt;, for territory strategy, customer relationships, and international expansion and will participate in weekly pipeline reviews, forecasting, and sales process alignment with the US team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chat with Christy - Business Recruiter - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Review - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery Mock Interview - 45-60 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Interview - ~2.5 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief Background Check and Reference Check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, and we’ll keep you informed at every stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation range for this role is&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;280-340k CHF&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;OTE&lt;/strong&gt;, 50/50 split, depending on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation follows a standard 50/50 enterprise sales structure consisting of base salary and target commission. High performers are eligible for uncapped commission accelerators above quota.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, we offer competitive equity, benefits, and significant growth opportunities as one of our earliest international commercial hires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final compensation will be determined based on experience, qualifications, and demonstrated enterprise sales performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our people the same way we invest in our product: seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🩺 Health, Vision, and Dental benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏝️ Take-what-you-need Paid Vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;➕ Life Insurance and Accidental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❤️‍🩹 Short-Term Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 Generous salary and equity for all staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🪜 401k option; helping you save for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒 Paid parental leave to support growing families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 Yearly learning and development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚌 Commuter benefits for Bay Area and New York employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚘 Uber ride stipend if you ever have to work late in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏡 Remote office home stipend to get you comfy in your space for remote employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;📸 Free professional headshot&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍔 Daily catered lunches and dinners provided in office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Complimentary On-Site Gym: Our SF office has a fully equipped gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✈️ Onboarding trip to one of our offices if you work remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥤 Monthly happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎉 Annual Company Offsites; our last one was in Palm Springs CA 🌴&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an in-person company. Our offices in San Francisco, New York City and London are where ideas get built, decisions get made, and the team gets stronger. We have invested in making them genuinely great places to spend your day, with catered lunches, monthly happy hours, and people who care about the work and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of our team works in office five days a week. For select roles, we hire remotely across the U.S. Remote employees come to one of our offices for their first week to onboard and meet the team, and we cover the full trip.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every role is different. Travel expectations are always shared upfront in the job description and confirmed in your first call with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We make all employment decisions based solely on merit. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees without discrimination on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, disability status, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We prohibit any form of discrimination or harassment. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please review Pallet’s Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pallet.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet complies with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA), as amended by the ADA Amendments Act, and all applicable state or local laws. We will reasonably accommodate qualified individuals with a disability during the application process and throughout employment as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance or accommodations due to a disability, please contact us at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a ----------<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Auterion builds a cutting-edge operating system for autonomous robotic systems that empower a diverse range of platforms to perform surveillance, reconnaissance, inspection, mapping and logistics tasks. Our industry-leading software drives the adoption of robotic fleets and is recognized by the U.S. government as the future standard for its drone programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Embedded Performance Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who is passionate about getting the most out of embedded systems — from low-level Linux tuning and hardware integration to high-performance video and data pipelines. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys working close to hardware, moving across the stack, and solving the kinds of problems where milliseconds, bandwidth, startup time, and system efficiency matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across the AuterionOS ecosystem on topics such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Linux performance and system tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-latency video streaming and media pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C/C++, Python, and Bash-based platform development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware integration, system profiling, and end-to-end optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with experienced and driven engineers across Auterion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within the Apps &amp;amp; Simulation team and collaborate with other development teams to build high-performance products for autonomous systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, optimize, and maintain performance-critical components within AuterionOS, Auterion’s custom embedded Linux distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve end-to-end system behavior across compute, networking, video, and hardware interfaces, with a strong focus on latency, throughput, reliability, and resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and optimize demanding workloads such as real-time telemetry, video streaming, media processing, and communication between distributed system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate system bottlenecks across the full stack, from kernel and OS behavior to application-level code and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and product teams to understand both internal and customer use cases, and translate them into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and implement new platform capabilities with a strong emphasis on measurable performance gains in real-world deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in daily stand-ups, release planning, and prioritization discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. or M.Sc. in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience writing object-oriented C++ and/or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with embedded Linux systems, including cross-compilation, debugging, profiling, and performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on background in diagnosing and optimizing real-world system behavior, including CPU, memory, I/O, networking, boot time, and application latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or optimizing low-latency video or data-streaming pipelines, ideally on embedded platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of software systems that span embedded devices, higher-level applications, and fully integrated products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, implementation, debugging, and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video codecs, GStreamer, RTP/RTSP, or hardware-accelerated media pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Debian/Ubuntu-based systems, Bash scripting, and systemd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and docker-compose in complex development and deployment environments, as well as qemu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging and performance analysis skills at both system and application level, combined with a proactive and self-directed working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in ROS2/DDS-style middleware and experienced with networking across multiple OSI layers, including REST APIs and performance-sensitive communication paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system integration and interfacing sensors or peripherals, especially via USB and Ethernet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile engineering environment with stand-ups, sprint planning, and shared ownership across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with build systems such as CMake, including improving build performance in large-scale software projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Public Affairs bij Burson&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wil jij ervaring opdoen op het snijvlak van politiek, media, bestuur en bedrijfsleven?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson staat voor strategie en communicatie, met adviseurs die door opdrachtgevers worden ingeschakeld als het er echt om gaat. Met ons ervaren team van specialisten opereren we op hoog strategisch niveau en helpen we bedrijven en organisaties door de meest complexe situaties: van het versterken of beschermen van reputaties tot het inspelen op veranderende wetgeving, het agenderen van politieke thema’s, het begeleiden van fusies en overnames, productintroducties of crisiscommunicatie. We zijn onderdeel van Burson Group, een internationaal communicatiebureau bestaande uit een groot netwerk met meer dan 95 kantoren in ruim 40 landen. Samen maken wij onderdeel uit van WPP: het grootste marketing- en communicatiebedrijf ter wereld. Sinds 2019 zijn wij onder één dak gevestigd op onze Amsteldok-campus in Amsterdam. Daarnaast hebben wij in Nederland ook een kantoor in Den Haag.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Public Affairs bij Burson is veel meer dan lobbyen op het Binnenhof. In de huidige mediacratie wordt beleid steeds vaker beïnvloed door publieke opinie en politieke sentimenten. Hierdoor verschuift de macht: niet alleen overheid en markt bepalen de agenda, maar ook de samenleving zelf. &amp;nbsp;Onze adviseurs helpen organisaties om in te spelen op deze dynamiek: maatschappelijke trends signaleren, draagvlak creëren bij uiteenlopende stakeholders, en strategieën ontwikkelen die zowel politiek als publiek overtuigen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als geïntegreerd communicatieadviesbureau weten wij hoe we Public Affairs versterken met slimme PR en gerichte communicatie, zodat we de juiste doelgroep bereiken, op het juiste moment, via het juiste kanaal, met de juiste boodschap. Daardoor richten ons op het beïnvloeden van relevante stakeholders via een breed scala aan kanalen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson stelt jaarlijks per 1 februari en 1 september een Public Affairs stage beschikbaar aan een talentvolle student.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als stagiair Public Affairs werk je mee aan diverse projecten en ondersteun je onze adviseurs. Je maakt kennis met veel aspecten van het werk binnen een Public Affairs kantoor en krijgt een uniek kijkje achter de schermen van de politieke arena. Je leert hoe organisaties hun belangen behartigen richting politiek, overheid en media. Kortom: een veelzijdige stage op het raakvlak van politiek, bestuur, media en bedrijfsleven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je werkzaamheden bestaan onder andere uit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoren van nieuws en politiek:&lt;/strong&gt;dagelijks kranten, vakbladen en opinietijdschriften scannen op relevant nieuws voor onze klanten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Volgen van parlementaire agenda’s:&lt;/strong&gt;bijhouden van vergaderingen en debatten in de Tweede en Eerste Kamer, relevante Kamerstukken signaleren en samenvatten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verslaglegging&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;live en achteraf rapporteren over politieke debatten en griffieverslagen verzamelen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research en analyse&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;informatie verzamelen via databanken en analyses maken voor onze adviseurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholdermapping&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;relevante politieke en ambtelijke contacten in kaart brengen en up-to-date houden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ondersteuning bij diverse klantprojecten&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;bijdragen aan presentaties, pitches en strategische adviezen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je volgt een HBO- of universitaire opleiding, bijvoorbeeld Politicologie, Bestuurskunde, Geschiedenis, Europese Studies of Internationale Betrekkingen (en staat ingeschreven tijdens de stageperiode).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een grote interesse in en kennis van de Nederlandse politiek en maatschappelijke vraagstukken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent proactief, nieuwsgierig en analytisch sterk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt complexe informatie helder analyseren en samenvatten en hebt een vlotte pen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheerst de Nederlands en Engels taal, zowel mondeling als schriftelijk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt goed omgaan met deadlines en werkt nauwkeurig, ook onder druk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent minimaal vier dagen per week beschikbaar in de periode van 1 februari tot en met 30 juni.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tijdens je stage ontvang je een maandelijkse stagevergoeding van €650 (gebaseerd op een volledige werkweek) en word je begeleid door twee collega’s. Elke maand heb je een coachingsgesprek over je eigen ambities en wensen. Halverwege je stage is er een tussentijds feedbackgesprek waarin genoeg ruimte is om aan te geven wat je nog meer uit je stage wil halen. Daarnaast kun je altijd terecht bij andere Young Professionals, consultants en senior-adviseurs met vragen. Tenslotte worden je reiskosten vergoed en is het mogelijk om zo nu en dan eens vanuit huis te werken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteren&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heb je interesse? Stuur dan uiterlijk 30 november je cv en motivatiebrief in via onderstaande link of naar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;E: -----
&lt;p&gt;Joost Reede, T: 06 – 34 55 50 18,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hoe versterken we de reputatie van één van de grootste werkgevers van Nederland? Welke influencers schakelen we in bij een lancering van een nieuw product? Hoe zorgen we dat de onze klant goed in de media komt? Als jouw hart sneller gaat kloppen van deze vragen, dan zijn wij op zoek naar jou!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Stage lopen bij Burson betekent dat je meteen veel verantwoordelijkheden krijgt. Als stagiair maak je écht onderdeel uit van ons team en word je zoveel mogelijk betrokken bij verschillende activiteiten.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je werkt nauw samen met je collega’s aan opdrachten voor merken zoals SharkNinja, Jaguar Land Rover en Procter &amp;amp; Gamble (o.a. Gillette, Always en Olay). Afhankelijk van de klanten in jouw portfolio ondersteun je bijvoorbeeld bij andere inhoudelijke taken als het verzamelen van relevante informatie, het maken van media-, concurrentie- of stakeholderanalyses, het meedenken over de invulling van nieuwe social media- of influencer-campagnes en het creëren van content voor verschillende kanalen. Er wordt hard gewerkt in de diverse klantteams, maar de werksfeer is open, informeel en eigen initiatief wordt zeer gewaardeerd!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie zijn wij? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Burson staat voor strategie en communicatie, met adviseurs die door opdrachtgevers worden ingeschakeld als het er echt om gaat. Wij helpen bedrijven en organisaties in de meest uiteenlopende en vaak uitdagende omstandigheden, waarbij wij ze adviseren in hun transities en transformaties. Met het creëren van stakeholderacceptatie als doel. Nooit om de status quo te beschermen, niet om op elke hype in te gaan, maar om ze met een gegronde strategie toekomstbestendig te maken.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Onze adviseurs zijn met hun brede ervaring, vakmanschap en integriteit erkende boardroompartners. Onafhankelijk en kritisch zetten zij de discussie met onze opdrachtgevers op scherp. Burson heeft jarenlange ervaring in het adviseren van bedrijven in complexe situaties, onder meer op het gebied van strategie, stakeholdermanagement en geloofwaardige communicatie.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We zijn onderdeel van Burson Group, een internationaal communicatiebureau bestaande uit een groot netwerk met meer dan 95 kantoren in ruim 40 landen. Samen maken wij onderdeel uit van WPP: het grootste marketing- en communicatiebedrijf ter wereld. Sinds 2019 zijn wij onder één dak gevestigd op onze Amsteldok-campus in Amsterdam. Daarnaast hebben wij in Nederland ook een kantoor in Den Haag.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Heb jij je altijd al afgevraagd hoe het is om stage te lopen bij een internationaal communicatiebureau? Ben je goed op de hoogte van het laatste nieuws? Weet je je weg te vinden in de onlinewereld? Ben je communicatief vaardig, leergierig en stel je altijd de juiste vragen? Dan past deze stage perfect bij jou.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je staat open voor nieuwe ideeën en opvattingen, bent breed geïnteresseerd en zoekt graag dingen tot op de bodem uit. Bij ons zijn studenten van alle studieachtergronden welkom die geïnteresseerd zijn in communicatie, marketing en media.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tijdens je stage ontvang je een maandelijkse stagevergoeding van €650 (gebaseerd op een volledige werkweek) en word je begeleid door twee collega’s. Elke maand heb je een coachingsgesprek over je eigen ambities en wensen. Halverwege je stage is er een tussentijds feedbackgesprek waarin genoeg ruimte is om aan te geven wat je nog meer uit je stage wil halen. Daarnaast kun je altijd terecht bij andere Young Professionals (trainees), consultants en senior-adviseurs met vragen. Tenslotte worden je reiskosten vergoed en is het mogelijk om op vrijdagen&amp;nbsp; vanuit huis te werken.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthousiast?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solliciteer dan via onderstaande link!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je kunt solliciteren t/m 1 december. &lt;/strong&gt;De gesprekken zullen dan in de weken erna plaatsvinden. De startdatum van de stage is flexibel, maar idealiter 1 februari.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vragen? Neem contact op met Lauren: ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Senior Commercial Solutions Engineer, you will work with both commercial and some enterprise prospects and customers in Belgium, aligning their goals and requirements with SentinelOne&#39;s offerings across prevention, XDR, and threat hunting. You will play an instrumental role in accelerating our sales initiatives, partnering closely with the sales team to design and propose security solutions that address the unique challenges of our customers. If you are a self-starter who thrives in a high-paced environment and is energized by pitching revolutionary technology to executives and security practitioners alike, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work closely with our sales team to design and propose security solutions that meet the unique needs of commercial and enterprise customers in Belgium, applying technical and commercial expertise to address diverse cybersecurity challenges and creatively resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead the Proof of Concept lifecycle from delivering demos through to technical closing, demonstrating strong problem-solving and analytical skills, and provide first and second-level technical support throughout the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and showcase a deep understanding of SentinelOne&#39;s products and solutions, aligning technical capabilities with customer needs and pain points, and deliver engaging security workshops and demonstrations to both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the channel, covering partner networks and engaging with selected enterprise customers, while providing valuable feedback to product management on product features and market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrate objection handling and competitive positioning skills across a range of customer engagements, communicating effectively with CxO-level, technical, and non-technical stakeholders as part of the broader EMEA team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluency in English, Dutch or French, with 3 to 6 years of experience in pre-sales within the cybersecurity industry and a proven track record of successfully selling to large customers and managing complex, competitive sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong technical depth across endpoint security, XDR, and threat hunting, with good knowledge of hacking and exploitation tools and methodologies, detection evasion techniques, and notable malware and anti-malware solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience speaking to both small and large audiences, with excellent presentation skills and the ability to lead business and technical presentations, demonstrations, and conversations with executives and technical practitioners alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A team-focused approach, positive attitude, and the ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a larger EMEA team, with a high level of technical curiosity and a passion for emerging technologies across endpoint, mobile, and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience in computer forensics, security architecture, penetration testing, red teaming, or incident response is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
