&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starte durch - mit uns:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Werde Teil unseres internationalen Teams in einem Umfeld, das echtes Wachstum und eine „Act like an Owner“-Mentalität fördert. Bei uns hast du die Chance, Projekte eigenverantwortlich voranzutreiben, neue Ideen zu testen und direkt miterleben zu können, wie deine Arbeit in unserem schnell wachsenden Unternehmen Wirkung zeigt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nachhaltigkeit als Kern:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil der Revolution. Du trägst zu einer grüneren Zukunft bei - durch unsere 100 % elektrische Flotte und eine Lieferkette, die Lebensmittelverschwendung reduziert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unvergessliche Momente:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir sind mehr als nur ein Team. Von unserem legendären jährlichen Ski-Trip über Weihnachtsfeiern bis hin zu Auftritten unserer eigenen Picnic-Band: Wir feiern unsere Erfolge gemeinsam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wohlbefinden &amp;amp; Gleichgewicht: &lt;/strong&gt;Wir bieten dir professionelle Unterstützung für deine mentale Gesundheit mit OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Simtra ist ein erstklassiges Auftragsentwicklungs- &amp;amp; Herstellungsunternehmen, welches seit über 65 Jahren in Zusammenarbeit mit mehr als 60 internationalen Kunden weltweit sterile, injizierbare Arzneimittel auf den Markt bringt. Unser Hauptaugenmerk liegt hierbei auf der Herstellung von Krebstherapeutika. &lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Mit der Unterstützung von über 2.000 Mitarbeitenden an unseren drei Standorten in Bloomington, Indiana, USA; Parsippany, New Jersey, USA und Halle/Westfalen, Deutschland&lt;/span&gt;, können wir unseren Kunden ein breites Portfolio von Verabreichungssystemen anbieten, darunter vorgefüllte Spritzen, flüssige/lyophilisierte Fläschchen, Verdünnungsmittel für die Rekonstitution, mit Pulver gefüllte Fläschchen und sterile Kristallisation. Neben der GMP-Herstellung bieten wir auch weitere Dienstleistungen an, darunter Unterstützung bei der Formulierung und Entwicklung, Gefriertrocknungsoptimierung, globale regulatorische Unterstützung sowie Sekundärverpackung.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Simtra wird aus vielseitigen Teams in verschiedenen Bereichen gebildet! Werden Sie ein Teil des Teams und unterstützen Sie zukünftig dabei Patienten weltweit lebensverändernde Medikamente zur Verfügung zu stellen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir produzieren in unserem Werk in Halle/Westfalen Arzneimittel zur Therapie verschiedener Krebs- und anderer lebensbedrohenden Erkrankungen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Für unser Team suchen wir Dich als erfahrenen &lt;strong&gt;Senior Betriebsingenieur &lt;/strong&gt;/ &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manufacturing Engineer (m/w/d).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Senior Manufacturing Engineer (m/w/d) übernimmst Du eine Schlüsselrolle an der Schnittstelle zwischen Produktion, Technik, Qualität und externen Partnern. Du stellst sicher, dass unsere Anlagen zuverlässig, GMP-konform und zukunftsfähig betrieben werden – und leistest damit einen direkten Beitrag dazu, lebensverändernde Medikamente sicher und effizient verfügbar zu machen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In dieser Position sicherst Du im laufenden Betrieb die Einhaltung von GMP- und EHS-Standards. Dein Schwerpunkt liegt auf der technischen Verfügbarkeit unserer Produktionsanlagen, einem strukturierten Wartungs- und Ersatzteilmanagement sowie der kontinuierlichen Verbesserung von Anlagen und Prozessen in der Pharmaproduktion. Zu Deinen Aufgaben gehören:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verantwortest die Instandhaltung unserer Anlagen, zum Beispiel Kessel- und Rührsysteme sowie Filtrationsanlagen mit Isolatortechnik, und nutzt dafür ein Maintenance Management System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst die Planung und Einhaltung des Wartungsbudgets, der Terminierungen und der Leistungsparameter sowie die Koordination interner und externer Dienstleister&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Als technische Expertin bzw. technischer Experte begleitest Du den Produktionsbetrieb, analysierst systematisch Fehler und Prozesse und treibst Optimierungen mithilfe von Lean- und Six-Sigma-Werkzeugen voran&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du erstellst GMP-gerechte Projekt- und Qualifizierungsdokumentationen (u.a. Lastenheft, Pflichtenheft, Risikoanalyse, DQ-/IQ-/OQ-Dokumentation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du koordinierst und führst Qualifizierungs-, Validierungs- und Optimierungsmaßnahmen durch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Als technischer Ansprechpartner (m/w/d) übernimmst Du die Durchführung von Schulungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dich erwartet ein technisch anspruchsvolles Produktionsumfeld mit modernen Anlagen, klaren Qualitätsstandards und einem Team, das lösungsorientiert zusammenarbeitet. In Deiner Rolle kannst Du Verantwortung übernehmen, Verbesserungen aktiv vorantreiben und Deine technische Expertise sichtbar einbringen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei uns kannst Du Deine Expertise in einem hochregulierten Produktionsumfeld weiterentwickeln, technische Verantwortung übernehmen und Verbesserungen sichtbar mitgestalten. Wir unterstützen Dich dabei, Deine fachlichen und methodischen Kompetenzen auszubauen und Deine Erfahrung gezielt in anspruchsvolle Projekte einzubringen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bringst mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein abgeschlossenes Studium im Bereich der (pharmazeutischen) Verfahrenstechnik oder Maschinenbau, alternativ eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst einschlägige Berufserfahrung (5 bis 10 Jahre) im Bereich Betriebstechnik mit, gerne mit Schwerpunkt in der Herstellung pharmazeutischer Produkte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast Freude daran, technische Projekte eigenverantwortlich zu planen, umzusetzen und gemeinsam mit internen sowie externen Schnittstellen erfolgreich abzuschließen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Interesse und idealerweise Erfahrung in Automatisierungsthemen mit und möchtest technische Verbesserungen aktiv vorantreiben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein ausgeprägtes Verständnis für komplexe Prozesse, hohe Kommunikationsfähigkeit sowie eine lösungsorientierte und belastbare Arbeitsweise gehören zu Deinen Stärken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift sowie gute EDV- und Softwarekenntnisse, insbesondere in ERP-Systemen und MS Office, runden Dein Profil ab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neben einer verantwortungsvollen Aufgabe in einem internationalen Unternehmensumfeld bieten wir Dir ein kollegiales Team, kurze Wege am Standort Halle/Westfalen und die Möglichkeit, technische Themen mit hoher Relevanz für Patientinnen und Patienten weltweit aktiv mitzugestalten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire tarifgebundene Vergütung inkl. Sozialleistungen wie ein&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;13. Tarifgehalt, Urlaubsgeld&lt;/strong&gt;, betriebliche Altersvorsorge und eine zusätzliche Pflegeversicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hauseigene moderne Kantine mit attraktiver Be­zu­schus­sung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;plus Sonderurlaub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wochenarbeitszeit von&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;37,5 Stunden&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job-Rad Leasing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Benefits: Exklusive Rabatte für Mitarbeitende bei zahlreichen bekannten Marken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gute Verkehrsanbindung und kostenlose Mitarbeitendenparkplätze&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Berufsbedingter Umzug? Wir unterstützen finanziell im Rahmen unserer Umzugskostenpauschale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Betriebssportarten z.B. Badminton, Fußball und Fitnesskurse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engagierten und begabten Menschen bieten wir interessante Chancen in allen Phasen des Berufslebens. Geschlecht, Alter, Hautfarbe, Herkunft, sexuelle Orientierung und Beeinträchtigungen spielen dabei keine Rolle - im Gegenteil: Wir fördern Vielfalt und glauben, dass Diversität eine Bereicherung darstellt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns über die Zusendung der Unterlagen zu Ihrem bisherigen beruflichen Werdegang direkt über unser Online-System.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei Rückfragen wenden Sie sich gerne an Dinara Joneleit -----
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Um mehr über die Datenschutzrichtlinie von Simtra zu erfahren, lesen Sie bitte die globale Datenschutzrichtlinie der Simtra Recruitment Platform: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;menurird&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://simtra.com/de/recruitment-platform-datenschutzhinweis/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;» Recruiting Privacy Notice (DE)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Engine team develops and maintains core components of the Workato Recipe runtime. Scope includes recipe execution, DSL, event pulling, webhook processing, and job execution. The team owns trigger and event infrastructure that defines how integrations start and react to external events. Current focus: modernization of a high-throughput platform to improve reliability, scalability, and long-term evolvability. Work is platform-oriented and directly impacts runtime performance and system correctness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement distributed backend systems in Go with deep consideration of performance and memory behavior.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work on runtime-level components operating under high concurrency and throughput.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply in-depth knowledge of Go internals (scheduler, memory model, garbage collection behavior) to improve system efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and optimize concurrent workflows using goroutines, channels, synchronization primitives, and context propagation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze and optimize slice usage, memory allocations, and data structures for performance-critical paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve execution engine for custom third-party code (isolation, performance, feature extensions).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modernize runtime components with focus on modularity, structured architecture, and observability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve trigger configuration and execution across webhooks and polling mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrate and optimize data storage solutions (Postgres, S3, DynamoDB, Kafka, ClickHouse).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify bottlenecks, race conditions, deadlocks, and performance degradation in distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own initiatives end-to-end, from design to rollout and production support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct code reviews with emphasis on correctness, concurrency safety, and performance characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong experience in building scalable distributed backend applications (7+ years).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great understanding of all building blocks of large web applications: databases, load balancers, application servers, message brokers, caching, monitoring, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good understanding of network protocols and stacks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good understanding of DB technologies: classic databases and modern no-SQL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of basic data structures and algorithms and how they are used is a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multilingual programming experience: our code base is primarily in Ruby, with trend to migrate to GOlang and Rust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent debugging, analytical, problem solving, and social skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BS/MS degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related subject, 7+ years of industry experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Readiness to work remotely with teams distributed across the world and timezones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in network programming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in application, data security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep knowledge of physical DB design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience of working with Docker and other isolation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience of working with public cloud infrastructure providers(AWS/Azure/Google Cloud).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in related fields (DevOps, ML, DBA, Enterprise applications, etc).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in building/deploying data processing pipelines is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience of working with third-party REST APIs at scale (request throttling, batch processing etc).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2997)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Associate Director, Commercial Strategy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12-month maternity cover | VML Health | London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director, Commercial Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to join VML Health’s Global Strategy Team on a 12-month maternity cover contract.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, hands-on strategy role for someone who understands the pharmaceutical and healthcare landscape and can turn complex scientific, market and stakeholder insight into clear commercial direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with global healthcare clients across the product lifecycle, from early pipeline and commercialisation through launch and indication expansion, helping shape how assets, franchises and portfolios can create sustainable competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex &lt;strong&gt;commercial strategy programmes&lt;/strong&gt; across early commercialisation, launch and indication expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape strategy across &lt;strong&gt;competitive differentiation, category and ecosystem strategy, evidence, scientific narrative and value proposition&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn scientific, market, competitor and stakeholder insight into clear, actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead research and strategic engagement with &lt;strong&gt;HCPs, KOLs, patient advocates, policymakers and other external experts&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted senior client relationships and lead integrated teams across strategy, creative, medical education, engagement and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects confidently across scope, resources, risks and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow client relationships and support pitches and new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and support junior strategists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around &lt;strong&gt;7+ years&#39; experience&lt;/strong&gt; in healthcare strategy, consulting or a related pharma/biotech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;pharmaceutical and healthcare landscape&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally across multiple therapy areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering commercialisation strategy from &lt;strong&gt;early pipeline through launch and/or indication expansion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence leading complex strategic engagements and working with senior clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong primary and secondary research skills, including workshops, advisory boards and expert engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic thinking and storytelling, with the ability to create clear, compelling, executive-ready recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness and the ability to connect asset-level strategy to the wider &lt;strong&gt;portfolio, category and market context&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style and experience supporting more junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About VML Health&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Health is a global healthcare agency with a vision to make the world of health human-first. With global healthcare hubs in &lt;strong&gt;London, New York and Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, we bring together strategy, science, creativity and engagement to help solve complex healthcare challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our &lt;strong&gt;Commercial Strategy team in London&lt;/strong&gt;, working as part of an integrated global strategy community across Medical, Engagement, Brand and Commercial Strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;QE partners with engineering teams to own test strategy, coverage, and quality-by-design. We&#39;re not a separate QA checkpoint — we enable engineering teams to ship fast with confidence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead and manage a team of quality engineers: hiring, performance, and career growth, while staying hands-on enough to make calls on testing, test strategy, and quality debt. Working manager role — technical credibility matters as much as people skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, manage performance, and drive career growth for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make quality-related technical calls: review MRs, test plans, improve test strategy, drive metrics on test coverage, customer issues, quality debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own execution and prioritization for your team&#39;s quality commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and/or maintain the dashboards and metrics that give visibility into quality health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a proactive, clear quality narrative to your manager and partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering managers, PMs, designers, and peer QE managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up team processes (release pipelines, test planning, escalations, etc) that hold up without you checking every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio-level view of quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a team management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in quality engineering/quality assurance, Senior/Staff+ level prior to managerial role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced managing QA/QE or test automation engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth in test planning, test strategy, automation, and quality metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building tools and processes that other teams adopt and rely on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coach who gives specific, direct feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, manage performance, and drive career growth for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make quality-related technical calls: review MRs, test plans, improve test strategy, drive metrics on test coverage, customer issues, quality debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own execution and prioritization for your team&#39;s quality commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and/or maintain the dashboards and metrics that give visibility into quality health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a proactive, clear quality narrative to your manager and partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering managers, PMs, designers, and peer QE managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up team processes (release pipelines, test planning, escalations, etc) that hold up without you checking every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio-level view of quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating non-deterministic or generative outputs (LLM/GenAI features)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with eval frameworks, golden datasets, or scoring rubrics for measuring output quality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge in at least one of: Kotlin, Python, JavaScript, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of testing methodologies and QA domain theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with different test automation frameworks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong test design skills on all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Test Management Systems (e.g., Allure TestOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and containerization (Kubernetes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of CI/CD and continuous delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI tools, with a track record of using them to raise quality, speed up testing and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to search relevance or ranking quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up and configuring CI/CD tools and pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of GraphQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Performance Engineering (k6 or similar) and Observability (OpenTelemetry/Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Is the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on the lookout for a Senior Java Engineer to join our Elasticsearch team and focus on ensuring that the shared platform functionalities of Elasticsearch are easy to use, performant, maintainable and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team’s mission is to create foundational infrastructure and shared functionality that enables engineers to develop, extend, and support Elasticsearch. The team owns common functionality such as services, settings and scripting, and makes Elasticsearch extensible through plugins or the Painless scripting language. The team also makes Elasticsearch observable by providing logging and telemetry information. We also own the orchestration of Elasticsearch in serverless, the CI/CD workflows and enable Elasticsearch developers to deliver Elasticsearch to customers - serverless, cloud and on-premise alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a strong individual contributor on the team but you will also contribute to and lead cross team projects. We need someone who has great design skills, who can work at a low level of abstraction but can equally drive and communicate technical concepts across a variety of collaborators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to large, impactful projects that evolve the core infrastructure that underpins Elasticsearch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making Elasticsearch developers more productive by identifying and developing opportunities for automation, and integrating agentic apps into development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and implementing new horizontally-scalable features and APIs in Elasticsearch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving difficult issues, including performance or concurrency issues, and proposing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving operation and observability of Elasticsearch cloud systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating in the open with the ES team, Elastic users, and other supporting open source projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our support engineers with the harder problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning operational investigations end-to-end, until performance or stability issues are successfully resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience crafting APIs and the ability to reason through tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in algorithms and data structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in core Java and are conversant in the standard library of data structures and concurrency constructs, as well as newer language features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with low-level Java such as concurrency, parallelism, classloaders, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of JDK internals: modules, the Java memory model, garbage collection, database load, caching techniques, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading large scale projects across engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to dive into new issues and ask for help when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to own projects from beginning to end. This covers both technical design and working with others to develop needed components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of using AI to accelerate development, debug complex systems, and optimize code, while still owning the final outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess the ability to collaborate across functions and teams and seamlessly transition between different projects, codebases, or teams based on business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work autonomously, drive decisions and results in a distributed team by leveraging asynchronous, direct, and transparent communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a platform team or developer productivity team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with CI/CD systems and practices (Buildkite, Argo CD, GitOps etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Java build tools (Gradle, Maven, etc), with a strong preference for Gradle experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and telemetry solutions, particularly OpenTelemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of containers and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Is The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on the lookout for a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to join our &lt;strong&gt;Elasticsearch - Distributed Systems team &lt;/strong&gt;and focus on how Elasticsearch provides scale, performance, and resilience, especially in the context of our Serverless offering. You will be tackling deep distributed systems challenges in how nodes in an Elasticsearch cluster communicate, and how data are indexed, allocated, and managed across nodes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging your deep distributed systems expertise to design, build, and operate core pieces of our next-generation Serverless Elasticsearch offering, directly impacting the experience of customers worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving Elasticsearch’s components that support concurrent and consistent indexing across multiple machines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining our cluster coordination system to keep performance high even though nodes come and go from the cluster and data moves around, while maintaining the safety and liveness properties of the system as a whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pushing the limits on the number of shards, nodes, and petabytes that Elasticsearch can handle today.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Looking into all kinds of issues, including performance or concurrency issues, and proposing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our support engineers with the harder problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning operational investigations end-to-end, until performance or stability issues are successfully resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep background in distributed systems and consensus algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong skills in core Java and are conversant in the standard library of data structures and concurrency constructs, as well as newer language features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep technical proficiency in algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building large-scale distributed systems, rather than making use of off-the-shelf services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building and debugging complex features with a broad impact, running on multiple machines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to own projects from beginning to end. This covers both technical design and working with others to develop needed components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing projects involving multiple engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of using AI to accelerate development, debug complex systems, and optimize code, while still owning the final outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess the ability to collaborate across functions and teams and seamlessly transition between different projects, codebases, or teams based on business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work autonomously, drive decisions and results in a distributed team by leveraging asynchronous, direct, and transparent communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search, analytics, Lucene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the JDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asynchronous event-driven network frameworks such as Netty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Climate Matters More Than Ever&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supply chain leaders are being asked to cut costs and carbon at the same time. Yet logistics and sustainability teams often work with different data, tools, and priorities. Meanwhile, regulations and industry standards are raising expectations for how companies measure and manage their emissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most climate tools stop at reporting: a dashboard or a year-end PDF, produced long after a shipment has moved. They rarely reach the people deciding how to route goods, when to ship, or how much inventory to hold.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Climate team at Flexport is building emissions intelligence directly into the platform where supply chain decisions are made. We help customers weigh cost, speed, and emissions together—and turn that understanding into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexport already runs the shipments, holds the data, and provides the platform where customers manage their supply chains. That puts us in a strong position to connect climate insights with the operational decisions that drive emissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the primary engineer for Climate, working independently of our existing engineering teams and partnering closely with the Climate Manager, your main day-to-day business stakeholder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think of it as a small startup within Flexport: direct access to the business, a broad scope, and substantial ownership. Together with the Climate Manager, you will identify the most valuable problems to solve, shape the product direction, and turn ideas into reliable software. This role calls for someone who enjoys both deciding what to build and building it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things We ❤️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turning complex shipment and emissions data into clear, actionable choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with stakeholders and users to understand what would make their lives better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building simple, reliable products and learning from how people use them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finding opportunities where lower costs and lower emissions go together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking an idea from an ambiguous problem to a useful product in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Climate Programs Manager to understand customer needs, challenge assumptions, and translate business goals into a practical product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery from problem discovery and technical design through implementation, launch, operation, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build emissions intelligence into everyday supply chain decisions, including routing, transport mode, shipment timing, and inventory planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers identify opportunities to reduce emissions using Flexport’s shipment data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make lower-emission choices easier to understand and act on within existing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop products that help customers understand the wider environmental footprint of their supply chains, beyond freight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver useful improvements incrementally, balancing speed, scope, maintainability, and data accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with other engineering teams when your work depends on shared systems, integrations, or expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure whether what you ship solves the underlying problem, and use that evidence to decide what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience, with a strong engineering foundation and experience delivering production software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of working independently: you can bring structure to an unclear problem, set priorities, unblock yourself, and follow through without a detailed specification or constant direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment: you understand user needs, identify what is worth building, and make thoughtful tradeoffs between impact and effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with business stakeholders: you ask good questions, explain technical choices in plain language, and constructively challenge ideas when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to own features across the stack, including user interfaces, backend services, and data integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love of simple, well-tested code that is easy to extend and hard to break.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort taking responsibility for the reliability and maintenance of what you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action, combined with the judgment to recognize when you need input or help.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for learning quickly, including unfamiliar business domains and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal motivation to work on climate and environmental challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in climate technology, emissions accounting, logistics, or supply chain software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products in a startup or another small team with broad ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning complex data into customer-facing insights and decision tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior climate experience is a plus; curiosity and the ability to learn the domain matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your day-to-day work will center on a close partnership with the Climate Manager, with collaboration across engineering as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have substantial autonomy and will be expected to keep stakeholders aligned on priorities, progress, and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We build and launch incrementally, using feedback to guide the next step.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Amsterdam, we come to the office two to three times a week to collaborate, whiteboard, and spend time together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexport’s broader technology stack includes React, TypeScript, Ruby on Rails, Kotlin, Kubernetes, GraphQL, gRPC, Postgres, Kafka, and Snowflake. We welcome candidates from different technology backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in It for You?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct ownership of products that help customers make better supply chain and environmental decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape Climate technology with the autonomy of a small startup and the reach of Flexport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity participation and a defined pension contribution scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days based on full-time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully paid premiums for Flexport’s collective health insurance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunches, breakfast, snacks, and drinks in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Covered home-to-office commuting costs for employees living outside Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance and parental leave benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__background p-message_pane_message__message c-message_kit__message&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_container&quot; data-qa-unprocessed=&quot;false&quot; data-qa-placeholder=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__hover&quot; data-qa-hover=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
