&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;About SITS | Traxion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;SITS | Traxion specializes in Identity &amp;amp; Access Management, with 24 years of consulting experience and a team of 120 specialists. We work with organizations across sectors, including Schiphol Group, dsm-firmenich, Gemeente Rotterdam, Belastingdienst, E.ON, and Ayvens.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of the European IT security group SITS, we combine international collaboration with a flat organizational structure and a respectful, collaborative culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact and secure Europe’s digital identities? &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;Apply today!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Interested but have questions before applying? Contact &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to learn more about the role and whether it matches your experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SITS | Traxion, we believe diversity strengthens our teams and fosters innovation. We are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone, regardless of gender, background, or experience, can thrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunar Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Lunar Sales is a fast-track, 2-year development programme designed for ambitious professionals who want to accelerate their career at the intersection of AI, enterprise technology, and strategic sales.&amp;nbsp; If you have experience solving complex problems in a client-facing role, in management or strategy consulting or a leading industry strategy function and you are ready to bring that expertise into enterprise sales, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Program immerses you in every stage of the customer sales journey, supported by motivating leaders who will help accelerate your growth beyond expectations. If you&#39;re an innovative thinker who thrives on overcoming challenges, our Top Talent Sales Program will provide strategic significance, arming you with the knowledge and tools to address complex problems, create meaningful change and excel as an Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onboarding Period of 1-3 months with the whole Lunar Cohort one-site at the Celonis Munich Office.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast-track your growth in enterprise sales through our exclusive top talent program. You will gain hands-on experience selling AI-driven business transformation, build relationships with industry leaders across Celonis verticals, including Automotive, Manufacturing, Banking, FSI,&amp;nbsp; Life Sciences, Consumer Goods, Retail, Energy and Public Sector and develop the leadership skills needed to drive real change for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The program focuses on three key pillars&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Business Development &amp;amp; Executive Relationship Building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of generating your own pipeline through cold outreach, persona identification, and first meetings, driving directly towards concrete KPI and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with C-suite executives (CEO, CFO, COO, CDO/CIO) to address challenges and align with their strategic objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Tailored Solutions &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Celonis Context Model and AI capabilities to address critical business needs, delivering measurable impact and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align strategies with clients&#39; long-term business goals to maximize platform adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a highly collaborative cohort of peers featuring a great team who can tackle challenges together, a strong performance culture, and continuous shared learning experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional teams, including Value Engineers, Service Consultants, Marketing, BDRs, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with a senior Account Executive in a dedicated 1:1 mentorship model to accelerate your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the strategic and operational business needs of your target accounts and effectively communicate how Celonis and its AI-powered Process Intelligence Platform, will meet those to create real opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for delivering revenue in your allocated account patch by creating new business opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key stakeholder personas, cultivate strategic relationships, and build an internal network of champions to drive customer success and account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross Line-of-Business at C-level and below within your target organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become proficient in driving the sales process, following a structured, staged, programmatic flow through prospect, initial call, qualify, pitch to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Value Engineering or personally conduct comprehensive presentations and demonstrations tailored to specific use cases, including Celonis AI, Process Intelligence Graph and industry-specific solutions, showcasing the value of our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge strong partnerships, particularly with leading consulting firms, tech partners, and the Big4.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your team, which includes business development representatives, value engineers, partner managers, and marketing specialists, to ensure seamless collaboration and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on AI trends, process automation, and digital transformation to position Celonis as the intelligent backbone of enterprise operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record in Client-Facing Roles: &lt;/strong&gt;You bring 2–3 years of professional experience from a top-tier management consultancy, corporate strategy/transformation function, or leading enterprise technology company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Academic Foundation: &lt;/strong&gt;You studied Business Economics, Engineering, Informatics, or a related discipline. A Master&#39;s degree is preferred, but exceptional graduates with solid foundational knowledge are encouraged to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Drive &amp;amp; Career Acceleration: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re ready to accelerate your career in sales. You have a genuine interest in applying your professional experience to a dynamic sales environment and are excited to build expertise in enterprise software solutions and client success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; Process Intelligence Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a sharp ability to quickly understand how companies operate, identify inefficiencies, and recognize where Process Intelligence and AI unlock real value and drive transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Forward Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re genuinely curious about AI and emerging technologies, driven to deepen your business acumen, and passionate about understanding business processes and KPIs—particularly in Finance, Supply Chain, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring familiarity or hands-on experience in Manufacturing, Automotive, Consumer Goods, Retail, Financial Services, Telecommunications, or Utilities. This foundation helps you quickly grasp client contexts and add immediate value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: You communicate complex, strategic ideas with clarity and confidence in Business English. Fluency in Dutch is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Independent Thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: You bring a forward-thinking mindset with analytical capabilities. You think strategically, operate independently, and are comfortable owning challenges and driving solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adviseer en begeleid klanten naar optimale bedrijfsprocessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combineer strategie, technologie en leiderschap in één rol&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stap aan boord als Technical Lead Consultant en help onze klanten het maximale uit hun Microsoft-omgeving te halen. Jij bent de strategische sparringpartner die bedrijfsprocessen optimaliseert en vertaalt naar slimme technologische oplossingen.&amp;nbsp;Je wordt een integraal onderdeel van het klantteam en speelt een cruciale rol in het verhogen van klanttevredenheid en zakelijke groei door middel van deskundig advies en strategische technologie-implementatie. Deze rol biedt een unieke mix van business en techniek: jij adviseert én zet jouw technische expertise in om impact te maken.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw reisgezelschap &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij HSO Managed Services werk je in klantenteams die end-to-end verantwoordelijk zijn. Techniek, business en change komen samen, waardoor je korte lijnen, snelle besluitvorming en nauwe samenwerking met de klant ervaart. Je rol gaat verder dan beheer: je adviseert, innoveert en neemt verantwoordelijkheid voor proactieve monitoring, incidentmanagement, roadmap en optimalisatie van kritische processen. Samen met je collega’s creëer je jouw eigen groeipad.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw bijdrage aan de reis&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ontwikkel en presenteer verbeter-roadmaps en vertaal deze naar concrete opdrachten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adviseer klanten over toekomstige Microsoft-ontwikkelingen en innovaties;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werk nauw samen met Sales en Accountmanagement om klantwaarde te maximaliseren;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begeleid en coach consultants en developers, bewaak kwaliteit en deel best practices;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stem actief af met de Customer Team Manager en klanten over voortgang en kansen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat neem jij mee?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HBO/WO-opleiding (bij voorkeur IT &amp;amp; Business, Bedrijfskunde of vergelijkbaar);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring als (Senior of Lead) Technical Consultant met brede kennis van Microsoft Azure en cloudconcepten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke technische basis, bv opgedaan in development, engineering of vergelijkbare technische disciplines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke analytische en probleemoplossende vaardigheden;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uitstekende beheersing van de Nederlandse en Engelse taal, zowel in woord als geschrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat verzorgen wij? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bij HSO reis je niet alleen voor een baan maar voor een carrière vol ontdekkingen. Naast een marktconform salaris en een prestatiegerichte bonus, krijg je praktische benodigdheden en beleving:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibele werkplek: kies je basis Rotterdam, Veenendaal of thuiswerken, jij bepaalt de route;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobiliteitsvergoeding waarbij je of een auto kunt leasen of het bedrag toe kunt  &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;voegen aan je salaris. Daar bovenop krijg 100% betaald van de ov-kosten; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt deelnemen aan het leasefietsplan;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EUR 65,- netto vitaliteitsbudget, we vinden het belangrijk dat we gezond blijven en een veilige werkplek hebben, zowel op kantoor als remote;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opleidingsbudget, studiedagen en toegang tot onze Academy en GoodHabitz voor jouw leerexpeditie;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vakantiedagen + optie om 10 extra te kopen; workations mogelijk voor wie écht nieuwe houvast zoekt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dagelijkse verzorgde lunch, bedrijfsfeesten, sportactiviteiten en wekelijkse borrels om onze gezamenlijke reis te versterken.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onze wereldwijde route&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Microsoft Inner Circle-partner en internationaal opererend bedrijf biedt HSO jou toegang tot best practices, certificeringen en een wereldwijd netwerk van experts. Samen met ruim 2200 getalenteerde medewerkers in Europa, Azië en Noord-Amerika verlenen we ondersteuning op lokaal en internationaal niveau aan industriële bedrijven, retailers, financiële en zakelijke dienstverleners en overheidsinstellingen.&amp;nbsp;Je werkt in een dynamische omgeving waarin kennisdeling centraal staat en waarin je jouw expertise direct kunt inzetten om klanten te helpen transformeren. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join the journey? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Klaar om met ons op pad te gaan of vragen hierover?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neem contact op met Sheling via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----------<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE IDEAL CANDIDATE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a self-starter and problem-solver, skilled at leveraging technology and data to deliver top-tier analytics solutions. They thrive on addressing complex business challenges and are consistently effective in making high-judgment decisions at a rapid pace, even in the face of ambiguity and uncharted scenarios. Additionally, the ideal candidate is energized by a work environment where strategy, innovation, and decision-making are intentionally distributed, where transparency, agility, and data-driven insights are highly valued, and where colleagues at all levels hold each other to exceptionally high standards to serve Quince customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the US team to understand what exists that we need to replicate and the gaps that we need to build upon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain automated reports to track Marketing KPIs:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New/Returning Customers, LTV/CAC, Total vs. inc. ROAS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Marketing Channel: Paid Social, SEM, App, Affiliates etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM: Customer cohort, Database health + Lifecycle stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ad-hoc analyses to identify channel inefficiencies, scaling opportunities, areas for improving MER / Total ROAS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering and Performance team to deliver experimentation and incrementality studies: Geo-Lift tests, Channel Incrementality, Brand lift, MMM validation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, engineering and CRM to deliver:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data driven customer lifecycle programme including key drivers of high-value customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A/B and multivariate tests across lifecycle touchpoints that optimize revenue per visit, and Incremental LTV / Revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A multi-category approach to cross selling, identifying triggers and next best actions based on customer behaviour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data quality, governance (inc. GDPR) and AI usage best practices in collaboration with the US.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an integral part of the international team and contribute to their growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative field (e.g., Statistics, Mathematics, Economics, Data Science, or similar). Master’s degree is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in a data analytics/product analytics role, ideally with a focus on supply chain within an e-commerce or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and data visualization tools (e.g., Tableau, Looker, Power BIm Mixpanel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of statistical analysis and A/B testing; familiarity with Python or R is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret complex data and translate it into actionable insights, with a focus on detail, accuracy, and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to present data insights and recommendations effectively to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple projects and prioritize in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin / London with the ability to come into the Berlin / London office 4 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in running Geo-lift tests across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous e-commerce / multi-category experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Performance marketing (attribution) + CRM measurement background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to translate data analysis into action through storytelling and visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of core marketing metrics and how they interact to deliver profitable growth: LTV/CAC, ROAS, MER&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;(Vollzeit, ab sofort, unbefristet, Standort Berlin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fan Engagement, Content, Artworks – für dich ist ein Release erst rund, wenn alles zusammenpasst?&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Genau dafür suchen wir dich.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du machst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest kreativ an der erfolgreichen Vermarktung von Singles und Alben nationaler Künstler:innen im deutschen Musikmarkt gemeinsam mit dem/der Project Manager:in Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest weitgehend selbstständig, setzt Prioritäten eigenverantwortlich und handelst dein Zeitmanagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dabei verbindest du innovatives Storytelling mit datenbasierter Planung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du sorgst für eine authentische Umsetzung der künstlerischen Vision und definierst Look &amp;amp; Feel, visuelle CI sowie die kanalübergreifende Content-Strategie für Künstler:innen. Das gilt für Newcomer:innen wie für etablierte Artists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du entwickelst strategisch und kreativ Social-First-Kampagnen mit Fokus auf plattformspezifische Inhalte &amp;amp; Zielgruppenaktivierungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verantwortest die Konzeption und Steuerung der Content-Strategie für Artistprojekte in Absprache mit den Künstlercamps (Social Media Content, Musikvideos &amp;amp; Co)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die eigenständige Erstellung von audiovisuellem Content und digitalen Assets gehört zu deinem täglichen Handwerkszeug.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du steuerst die Content-Produktion (Musikvideos, Fotoshootings, Contentdrehs, Artwork usw.) und übernimmst die Zusammenstellung des Creative Teams sowie die Abwicklung von administrativen Prozessen (Reiseplanung, Vertragserstellung, Rechnungsabwicklung etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du erkennst Trends und reichweitenstarke Partner:innen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du setzt dich mit den neuesten für uns relevanten Plattformen auseinander und bist up-to-date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst nach abgeschlossenen Kampagnen „Best-Practices“ and „Lessons Learned“ zur kontinuierlichen Verbesserung der Marketingstrategie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest sehr eng mit anderen Project &amp;amp; Creative Marketing Manager:innen, A&amp;amp;R Manager:innen, dem Promotion Team und weiteren Schnittstellen zusammen und ihr steht im ständigen Wissensaustausch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du berichtest direkt an die Head of Creative Marketing und gibst regelmäßig Empfehlungen zu Prioritäten, Risiken und kreativen Chancen innerhalb deiner Projekte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst eine aktive Vorbild- und Mentorenrolle für unsere Young Talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wer du bist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast mehrjährige Berufserfahrung in der Musik- und/oder Lifestyle-Kommunikation oder in einem vergleichbaren Bereich bei einem Label, Management oder einer Agentur gesammelt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast den Drive neue Maßstäbe zu setzen &amp;amp; eine Firstmover-Mentalität treibt dich an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist genreübergreifend ein absoluter Musiknerd und starke visuelle Kampagnen begeistern dich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein ausgeprägtes Gespür für Ästhetik, die den Zeitgeist trifft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Erfahrung mit in der Erstellung von audiovisuellen Inhalten sowie Online Assets und hast Erfahrungen im Umgang mit gängigen Bildbearbeitungs- und Videoschnittprogrammen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Im Steuern kreativer Prozesse kennst du dich gut aus und hast hier schon konkrete Erfolge im Musikmarkt begleiten können&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über ein Netzwerk von Kontakten in der Musik- und Medienbranche sowie zu relevanten Kreativen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du fesselst uns und unsere Zielgruppen dank strategischem Storytelling an die Smartphone Screens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist kreativ in den Lösungsansätzen und immer an den neuesten Trends interessiert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist sehr stark in der Kommunikation und kannst dich sehr gut auf verschiedene Charaktere und Situationen einstellen sowie besitzt ein sicheres Auftreten im Umgang mit Künstler:innen, Managements und weiteren Kooperationspartner:innen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist teamfähig, hast ein hohes Maß an Flexibilität, Belastbarkeit und Eigeninitiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projekt- und Zeitmanagement &amp;amp; Hands-On Mentalität gehören zu deinen Stärken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wir bieten dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
