&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an expert in your craft, with deep expertise in a specific design discipline and strong foundational skills across all areas of product design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable designing for AI and automation-enabled environments, and excited by the opportunities AI creates to rethink how services operate.&lt;/li&gt;
