&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Digital Procurement &amp;amp; Pricing team&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot;&gt;Digital Product Manager - Price Management (ContextIQ) (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt; on a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot;&gt;Permanent Contract (CDI)&lt;/strong&gt; based in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;158&quot;&gt;Lille (Upline)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Within Decathlon&#39;s digital organization, our team designs decision-support solutions for Procurement teams worldwide. Working hand in hand with the Purchase COE (Center of Excellence), we develop digital products such as ContextIQ, PYC, and Datacost to power strategic sourcing through context and data. We are looking for a Product Manager focused on business impact, user-centricity, and data-driven solutions to lead the evolution of ContextIQ.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;As the Digital Product Manager for ContextIQ, your mission will be to turn complex procurement needs into an intuitive user experience and a prioritized, high-value backlog:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Define the product roadmap, strategic vision, and clear success metrics (adoption, usability, business value delivered).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Discovery &amp;amp; Prototyping&lt;/strong&gt;: Uncover buyer needs, design intuitive user journeys, and test prototypes with users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Prioritization&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate business needs into clear user stories, prioritize features based on value, and collaborate closely with engineering teams throughout delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data Ecosystem &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with technical teams to ensure seamless integrations across the pricing ecosystem (PYC, Datacost), enforce data governance, and ensure data is AI-ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Change &amp;amp; Value Tracking&lt;/strong&gt;: Monitor feature adoption, gather user feedback, and foster tool engagement across global buyer communities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,0,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;25,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;Digital Product Management&lt;/strong&gt;, spanning discovery through delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,1,0&quot;&gt;Strong facilitation and active listening skills, with the ability to align cross-functional stakeholders (business, data, software engineering).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record in value-based prioritization, backlog management, and clear requirements documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,3,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with user testing and prototyping (proficiency in tools like Figma is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,4,0&quot;&gt;Genuine interest or experience in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;25,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;procurement, price management, or data analytics&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,5,0&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of technical integrations, data products, APIs, and data governance principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25,6,0&quot;&gt;Clear communication, strong analytical thinking, and comfort working in an evolving, collaborative environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;TECHNICAL STACK &amp;amp; ECOSYSTEM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product &amp;amp; Discovery Tools&lt;/strong&gt;: Figma, Jira, Confluence, product analytics &amp;amp; user feedback tools.&lt;/p&gt;
