&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;86mhok&quot; data-start=&quot;3243&quot; data-end=&quot;3375&quot;&gt;Curiosity to explore new technologies, including responsible AI and automation, to continuously improve engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
