&lt;p data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;1397&quot;&gt;As a Data Analytics Principal Consultant, you&#39;ll take a central role in supporting the continued growth of Capco&#39;s UK Data Practice. You&#39;ll lead complex data and analytics programmes across the Financial Services sector while mentoring talent, guiding clients and driving innovation across Cloud, AI and Machine Learning. You&#39;ll champion AI-enabled ways of working, helping clients and teams adopt modern approaches that improve productivity, accelerate insight and deliver measurable business outcomes, while ensuring responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
