&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1py9dkq&quot; data-start=&quot;3371&quot; data-end=&quot;3517&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop compelling executive presentations, influence senior stakeholders and communicate complex concepts with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lfx6sw&quot; data-start=&quot;3518&quot; data-end=&quot;3656&quot;&gt;Experience designing and facilitating executive workshops, aligning cross-functional stakeholders and driving strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;170sci6&quot; data-start=&quot;3657&quot; data-end=&quot;3843&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in ambiguity with a collaborative, outcome-focused approach and a curiosity for adopting AI-enabled methods that improve productivity, insight and delivery quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
