&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yc72di&quot; data-start=&quot;3870&quot; data-end=&quot;3979&quot;&gt;Strategy consulting experience within Financial Services, including banking, insurance or asset management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s8sfl3&quot; data-start=&quot;3980&quot; data-end=&quot;4104&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI regulation (such as the EU AI Act), AI governance, model risk management or responsible AI frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c96aj0&quot; data-start=&quot;4105&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;Understanding of modern data platforms, analytics capabilities and AI technologies from a strategic rather than technical perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qhd83a&quot; data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4357&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring consultants, developing strategy methodologies or building reusable consulting accelerators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xt4ayy&quot; data-start=&quot;4358&quot; data-end=&quot;4483&quot;&gt;Demonstrated thought leadership, proposition development or business development within AI, data or digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
