&lt;p data-start=&quot;5535&quot; data-end=&quot;5990&quot;&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know – we’ll be happy to help. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;i936vf&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;44&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;detail-content-block detail-content-block-tasks&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a seasoned &lt;strong&gt;Senior ASO Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to take on a pivotal role at Phiture, reporting directly to the Growth Lead and working closely with our key clients. As a key figure in our multidisciplinary marketing team, your responsibilities extend beyond client management. As a key figure in our multidisciplinary marketing team,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;you’ll lead client projects, mentor team members, and deliver strategies rooted in user behavior, experimentation, and impactful growth solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fixed-term engagement (approx. 10-12 months) starting as soon as possible.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead ASO and CRO-driven strategies&lt;/strong&gt; for global clients, ensuring scalable impact across markets and languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support key ASO clients&lt;/strong&gt; globally by providing guidance on strategic planning and roadmaps across multiple markets and languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply &lt;strong&gt;experimentation&lt;/strong&gt; methodologies to optimize app campaigns&#39; performance, &lt;strong&gt;combining ASO expertise with CRO principles&lt;/strong&gt; to drive conversion improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead keyword optimization &lt;strong&gt;(KWO)&lt;/strong&gt; projects to improve app discoverability across global markets, tailoring strategies to multiple languages and audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply &lt;strong&gt;creative testing&lt;/strong&gt; methodologies to optimize app store assets, helping clients stand out in competitive app marketplaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide Growth Managers to build robust analytical and strategic skills, encouraging curiosity and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine client strategies using a deep understanding of user behavior, app store dynamics, and growth experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Phiture’s influence on the mobile marketing industry (especially in ASO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent delivery of high-quality services and solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with industry trends and best practices, incorporating them into pod strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience in ASO&lt;/strong&gt; or related fields (e.g., CRO, performance marketing, experiment-driven mobile growth)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid knowledge of ASO &amp;amp; mobile marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, especially performance marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strategic mindset&lt;/strong&gt; with demonstrated expertise in experimentation, hypothesis testing, and user behavior analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong research skills&lt;/strong&gt; and critical thinking with a data-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity and adaptability&lt;/strong&gt;, with a willingness to learn the technical aspects of ASO if not already familiar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent client management skills&lt;/strong&gt; in an agency setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent English&lt;/strong&gt; skills (spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apple ads experience or any CAC:LTV based performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with complementary growth disciplines such as lifecycle marketing or funnel optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with A/B testing tools or experimentation platforms (Optimizely, Google Optimize, Hotjar, VWO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/article&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At AccountsIQ, part of the AIQ Group, we’re on a mission to deeply understand our customers and deliver technology that enriches their lives. Alongside ExpenseIn, a leading expense management platform within the group, we provide smart, feature-rich financial management software designed for ambitious businesses that have outgrown basic starter systems or seek a simpler, more affordable alternative to complex, costly ERP solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our cloud-based accounting software transforms the finance function, making it easier for multi-entity businesses to capture, process, and report their financial data with ease and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Marketing Manager to take the foundations set out in our growth strategy, our product vision and our customer focus and drive a throughline across every team, every launch and every customer touchpoint. You&#39;ll report to our Product Director and work closely with marketing, sales, account management, implementation and customer success, so the whole business tells the same story to the right customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;It&#39;s a hands-on role that balances strategy, operations and execution. You’ll inform critical decisions, do the work yourself and build the systems that let it scale. You&#39;ll also be the voice of our product, inside the business and out. There&#39;s plenty of room for this role to grow as the function does.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Understand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Know our best fit customers better than anyone. Deepen our understanding of who we serve best, our core segments and the people involved in buying and using our products. Feed that directly into product decisions, and make sure messaging and launches are built around it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reset competitive intelligence. Build a clear view of the landscape that helps teams win against the systems customers are outgrowing and the alternatives they&#39;re weighing up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shape&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop the complete value proposition. Work with product and service leads so today&#39;s product, what&#39;s coming and the service experience (onboarding, implementation and customer success) all deliver on our positioning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shape how customers see what we offer. Help evolve how our products and services are structured, named and packaged, in step with the roadmap, so the offer is easy to understand, shows where it&#39;s heading and gives every launch an obvious place to fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Connect product value to commercial results. Understand how each release adds value for customers, and help us capture it in new business, expansion and retention. Measure the impact of launches and enablement on pipeline, win rates and adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Deliver&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead the go-to-market rhythm. Run how product, marketing and customer-facing teams across our product family prepare for and deliver launches, so the right work happens at the right time and everyone knows where things stand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Be the voice of our product. Speak at customer roadshows, events and webinars, and give our point of view on market shifts, such as what AI means for finance leaders in the UK and Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strengthen our core, open up what&#39;s next. Make our proven go-to-market motion sharper while building new ones for the new segments our product roadmap opens up. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Enable the whole business. Make sure every team, from sales and customer success to support and product, understands our customers, segments, competitors and positioning well enough to move their own work forward at pace. Clear enough to act on, deep enough to rely on.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Turn positioning into pipeline. Work hand in hand with demand generation on campaign messaging, ABM plays, paid copy and outbound sequences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build a go-to-market system that stays current. Use AI and automation to keep customer and market insight flowing in, and keep messaging, battle cards, proof and customer stories up to date and easy to find.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Typically six or more years in B2B SaaS product marketing, including launches for a product bought through a considered, sales-led process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience being part of building or scaling a product marketing function, ideally in a scale-up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Scale-up instincts. You know what breaks as a business outgrows its earlier stage habits, and how to fix it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on use of AI to run product marketing better: synthesising research, keeping content current, and building workflows that save the team time, with the judgement to know when the output is right.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ownership of positioning and messaging, seen through to how the business sells, onboards and supports customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A track record of running go-to-market across product, sales and customer success, leading through influence rather than authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Customer understanding you&#39;ve built first-hand: interviews, win/loss, segmentation and personas, and evidence it changed what a product team built.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Based in the UK or Ireland, with regular time in our London and Dublin offices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Desirable:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience in finance, accounting or fintech software, especially selling to finance leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Marketing a multi-product suite, or bringing products and teams together&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working with an offer where experience (implementation, onboarding, customer success) is part of the value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s the hiring process?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;An initial call with our People Team to discuss your experience, career goals and interest in joining AccountsIQ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;An interview with our Product Director and our Product Consultant to explore your product marketing experience, strategic approach and commercial impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A short practical exercise presented to a panel from Product, Operations and Finance, focusing on your approach to positioning and bringing a product to market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work with us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AIQ Group brings together AccountsIQ and ExpenseIn, two ambitious SaaS businesses helping finance teams work smarter. In 2026, AccountsIQ was recognised as SaaS Provider of the Year at the International Accounting Awards and ranked #477 in the Financial Times FT1000 list of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Following a €60M investment in 2024, we&#39;re continuing to grow our products, our people and our impact, making this an exciting time to join the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our TEAM values aren&#39;t just words on a wall; they shape how we work every day:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Together - We work towards shared goals, support one another and celebrate success as one team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Energy - We bring curiosity, positivity and urgency, focusing on what matters most for our customers and colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Action - We take ownership, make decisions and deliver with purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mindset - We embrace feedback, think big and continually raise the bar for ourselves and each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re looking for a business that&#39;s growing quickly, values collaboration and gives people the opportunity to make a genuine impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of our perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave + bank holidays + your birthday off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working from abroad - up to 6 weeks per calendar year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Private Health Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5% Pension contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Life Assurance - 4 x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Income Benefit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Wellbeing initiatives &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that AccountsIQ Group may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organisation planning, and related purposes. AccountsIQ Group’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.accountsiq.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; explains what personal information we may process, where we may process your personal information, our purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over AccountsIQ Group’s use of your personal information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Charles River Associates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Charles River Associates is a leading global consulting firm that provides economic, financial, and business management expertise to major law firms, corporations and governments around the world. CRA advises clients on economic and financial matters pertaining to litigation and regulatory proceedings, and guides corporations through critical business strategy and performance-related issues. Since 1965, clients have engaged CRA for its combination of industry experience and rigorous, fact-based analyses that provide clients with clear, implementable solutions to complex business concerns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA&#39;s European Competition practice specialises in providing economic advice on matters of competition policy and regulation. &amp;nbsp;We assist firms and their legal advisors in all types of competition proceedings: &amp;nbsp;firms considering merger and acquisition opportunities or involved in merger control proceedings; and firms undergoing investigations relating to cartels, restrictive commercial agreements, abuse of dominance or state aid. &amp;nbsp;We also provide advice to firms involved in regulatory proceedings and sector inquiries. We offer assistance on the estimation effects of damages in cartel cases, international arbitration and intellectual property disputes. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on the Antitrust and Competition Economics practice in Europe visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com&quot;&gt;our website.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates will be expected to rapidly take on genuine responsibility, assisting Vice Presidents and other senior staff by providing conceptual and practical input to competition case work as required. The role brings with it the possibility of working on some of the largest and most significant competition cases in Europe, playing a key role in the shaping of the cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First degree in economics and a PhD/DPhil in economics from a well-regarded institution with a strong foundation in microeconomics, preferably with a specialism with large data sets (empirical PhDs) or Industrial Organisation and/or statistics/econometrics), plus up to 3 years of relevant work experience.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-PhD applicants should have strong academic achievement in a Master&#39;s program, plus 5-7 years&#39; relevant work experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional work experience in consulting, business, or with a competition authority strongly preferred;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of economic concepts, competition/regulatory authorities, competition policy and quantitative and qualitative analysis methods;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and oral communication skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated high level of initiative and leadership;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong teamwork and collaboration capabilities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and task prioritisation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;To Apply&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis. To be considered for this position, submit through this job posting:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curriculum Vitae&lt;/strong&gt; – please include current address, email and telephone number;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Covering letter&lt;/strong&gt; – please describe your interest in a role with CRA&#39;s Antitrust and Competition Economics practice in London and how this role matches your goals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Writing Sample (optional)&lt;/strong&gt; – we prefer a sole-authored submission from an existing work (work product, published article or job market paper) that includes your commentary on a quantitative analysis and/or relevant to the field of economics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transcripts (optional) &lt;/strong&gt;- from the most recent academic training (may be unofficial copies).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA creates a work environment that enables our colleagues to benefit from being together in the office to best deliver on our promise of career growth, mentorship and inclusivity. At the same time, we recognise that individuals realise a range of benefits when working from home periodically. We currently expect that individuals spend at least 3 to 4 days a week working in the office (which may include traveling to another CRA office or to client meetings), with specific days determined in coordination with your practice or team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible AI Use in Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that recruiting is fundamentally a human process, and we are committed to a hiring process that is consistent, transparent, and people-focused. While AI and other technology-enabled tools help our team operate more efficiently, we strive to provide every candidate with a personalized, thoughtful, and high-touch experience. As CRA invests significant human effort to find qualified members for our teams, we expect candidates to invest corresponding human effort to learn about CRA, prepare thoughtful application materials, and engage with our interviewers. Read more about appropriate hiring manager, recruiting team, and candidate AI at CRA &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/ai-recruiting/&quot;&gt;on our website&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Charles River Associates is an equal opportunity employer (Equality Act 2010). As part of our focus on equity and inclusion, we work to ensure a fair and consistent hiring process. We celebrate diversity and we are committed to an inclusive work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The statements included in this job description are intended to describe the general nature and level of work being performed by people assigned to this job. They are not intended to be an exhaustive list of all responsibilities, duties and skills required of personnel so classified.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire an experienced full-life cycle Technical Recruiter to support the organization through its growth, predominantly within Engineering and Product with the opportunity to support other functions, like Marketing, Legal, and GBO. You&#39;ll be a driving force in building and executing the talent strategy, partnering with key stakeholders, and hiring top talent. This role will allow you to build positive relationships, exude our values, and contribute to our org-wide recruiting best practices and processes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to execution on hiring, you will have the opportunity to support recruiting events, contribute to office expansion, and build strategic partnerships across the EMEA region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that will be held in our London hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage full-cycle recruiting processes for our technical organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business leaders to develop top of funnel strategies for key roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and build healthy, representative pipelines to engage passive talent including: cold outreach, events, and content production while also effectively handling inbound applications and referrals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to inform your hiring strategy and articulate these insights to executives in order to influence and drive positive change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and spearhead various initiatives relating to belonging, equity and impact (BEI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of full-cycle in house recruiting experience in a high growth business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior executives on Engineering, Tech &amp;amp; Product hiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build a talent strategy alongside your hiring managers, while delivering an exceptional candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, in all formats and ability to adapt communication style based upon audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will focus on recruiting in EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house experience recruiting for a SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring leadership roles at the Director level, predominantly within Engineering or Product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of the SaaS/ scaling tech landscape and who our competitors in this space may be&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application limits:&lt;/strong&gt; To help candidates focus on the opportunities most relevant to their skills and experience, Figma limits the number and frequency of applications. These limits apply to all roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

