&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tvm-operation__underline&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation Package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Healthcare Coverage (Health, Dental, Vision)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Savings Plan with an Employer Contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development Opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness Initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Global Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, free premium subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Discount Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Please note that we do not offer sponsorship for this position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Elite Technology, we embrace an employee-centric, flexible work model that empowers you to do your best work in the environment that suits you. However, we also recognize the importance of in-person collaboration for key moments that truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In our flexible remote approach, you have the freedom to choose a workspace within your home country that best fits your needs. Our corporate offices are located in New York City, Los Angeles, Costa Rica, and the Philippines, providing additional options for those who prefer or need a hybrid work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our diverse global team spans the U.S., Canada, U.K., Costa Rica, the Philippines, and Australia. Please note that at this time, we are unable to hire employees located in Quebec or Ontario Provinces, Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, Louisiana, and Oklahoma&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a global business, we rely on diversity of culture and thought to deliver on our goals. To ensure we can do that, we seek talented, qualified employees in all our operations around the world regardless of race, color, sex/gender, including pregnancy, gender identity and expression, national origin, religion, sexual orientation, disability, age, marital status, citizen status, veteran status, or any other protected classification under applicable law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer providing a drug-free workplace.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We also provide reasonable accommodation for qualified individuals with disabilities and for sincerely held religious beliefs in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are not accepting applications submitted through recruiting agencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;⭐&lt;strong&gt;DataDome delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, enabling businesses to trust the intent behind their traffic—human, bot, or AI agent. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome&#39;s multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily, analyzing the intent of every session so only trusted traffic reaches your business — powering growth across your sites, apps, APIs, and MCP servers. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 35+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering traffic you can trust.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team: &lt;/strong&gt;Reporting to the EMEA Head of Sales, you will be joining a team of 6 Account Executives, located both in New York and Paris and whose sole mission is to bring on new customers. This team has been the engine of DataDome exponential growth in the past years: be ready to join a rocket!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DataDome is a full SaaS solution, with a short Sales Cycle that allows new Account Executives to secure deals within their first 3 months after joining the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for generating new MRR (Monthly Recurring Revenue) by bringing on new enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;strong&gt;As the Account Executive, you will be more specifically in charge of things like..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#1 Originate and grow a strong and balanced pipeline:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- From your own hunting efforts on targeted accounts.&lt;br&gt;- From the highly qualified leads delivered by our Growth team.&lt;br&gt;- From the highly qualified leads delivered by our Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#2&lt;strong&gt; Ensuring high conversion rates for your leads and opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Make sure the leads and prospects are qualified following DataDome step by step Customer Journey. We use MEDDPICC as a framework to qualify our opportunities.&lt;br&gt;- Follow the company playbooks and guidelines, as well as established peers&#39; best practices and proactively find new creative solutions.&lt;br&gt;- Keep detailed track records of your progress and gather all relevant information in the CRM (we use Hubspot)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#3 &lt;strong&gt;Carrying out negotiations and closing deals.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Grow a deep understanding the prospects pain points, expectations and desired ROI (#MEDDPICC)&lt;br&gt;- Use the Free Trial as an opportunity to dig deeper and demonstrate DataDome added value&lt;br&gt;- Leverage DataDome offering to reach mutually beneficial agreements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;It would be great if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- You have a Bachelor degree or equivalent.&lt;br&gt;- You have at least 5 years SaaS solution Sales experience in Enterprise B2B with a track record of exceeding sales quotas.&lt;br&gt;- You are a Hunter and enjoy getting your own leads&lt;br&gt;- You are bilingual in French and English - any other European language is a plus&lt;br&gt;- You are eager to learn, and have a great ability to adapt in a constantly evolving and fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌟&lt;strong&gt; What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Fully remote position with the flexibility to work from anywhere in the UK + $500 stipend to help you set up your ideal home workspace.&lt;br&gt;- Generous Health Benefits&lt;br&gt;- A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;br&gt;- Events &amp;amp; Team building: Feel the #TeamSpirit both virtually &amp;amp; onsite, with several events and workshops planned throughout the year including two annual offsite events, summer &amp;amp; winter parties, lunch &amp;amp; learns, &amp;amp; much more.&lt;br&gt;- Professional Development: #Weaimhigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;br&gt;- Parent Care: Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;br&gt;- PTO: 25 days + national holidays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Initial chat with Talent Acquisition&lt;br&gt;- Interview with EMEA Head of Sales&lt;br&gt;- Case study with the team&lt;br&gt;- Interview with Chief Revenue Officer (US)&lt;br&gt;- Final conversation with our CEO&lt;br&gt;- Welcome to DataDome!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and proud to be committed to diversity and inclusion. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
