&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, commercially minded &lt;strong&gt;Senior Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to help Burson drive visibility, relevance and connection to the clients and prospects we most want to work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting at the heart of the UK Growth Team, this is a high-profile role working closely with the Chief Growth Officer and senior leaders across the business. You will help further Burson’s momentum in the UK having been named Cannes Lions Agency of the year 2026, turning our best thinking, expertise, people and client work into marketing that builds our reputation, creates demand and opens doors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for growing Burson&#39;s reputation and visibility in the market, strengthening engagement with priority audiences and building marketing programmes that support our growth ambitions across all areas of our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone with ideas, energy and excellent judgement. Someone who understands what makes senior decision-makers pay attention, knows how to turn complex expertise into compelling stories and can mobilise a busy organisation behind a great idea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver a focused UK marketing strategy that builds brand awareness, distinctiveness and demand, aligned with business and growth priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen Burson’s profile among&amp;nbsp;priority clients, prospects, industry influencers, business leaders and future talent, positioning us as a modern strategic advisory partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a distinctive&amp;nbsp;thought leadership and editorial programme, turning our expertise, insights, data and senior counsel into timely and compelling content across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key moments across the&amp;nbsp;business, media and cultural agenda where Burson can lead the conversation, mobilising experts and building the external profiles of senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an engaging events and experiences programme, including briefings, roundtables, webinars and partnerships that deepen relationships with clients and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcase Burson’s best work through case studies, credentials, awards and external storytelling, increasing visibility and recognition for our people, expertise and client impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a modern, high-performing marketing engine, using AI, automation, media intelligence, data and measurement to make marketing faster, smarter and more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with UK leadership, Growth, practices, capabilities and the EMEA Marketing Team to maximise commercial impact, amplify regional and global programmes, and share the best of Burson UK across the wider network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an ambitious marketer who combines the instincts of a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;marketer, editor and connector, and who likes making things happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record in B2B or professional-services marketing, ideally within strategic communications, consulting, creative, technology or another expertise-led business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence that you have helped build a brand, audience or market position, rather than simply managed marketing activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and delivering high-impact thought leadership, content and integrated marketing programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent editorial judgement. You know what makes an interesting point of view, what will engage an external audience and what won&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding writing and storytelling skills, with an ability to turn complex ideas into clear, engaging narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct and an understanding of the relationship between reputation, relationships, marketing and new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior leaders, including the ability to advise, influence and challenge constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of AI-enabled marketing, together with curiosity about how emerging technology can improve insight, creativity, personalisation, productivity and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the communications, marketing and wider business landscape, with a natural curiosity about what&#39;s happening in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to building external relationships with industry influencers, partners, media stakeholders and senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action. You spot opportunities, bring ideas and make them happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High standards and exceptional attention to detail, without allowing perfection to get in the way of momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and the ability to bring people together across Growth, practices, capabilities, creative teams and regional marketing colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help create a Burson UK that feels&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;impossible to ignore: sharper in the market, faster into important conversations and better at turning our expertise into reputation, relationships and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success will mean:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;greater visibility and distinctiveness for Burson amongst priority audiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;stronger engagement with the clients and prospects we most want to reach;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a recognisable and consistent flow of distinctive Burson attitude, thinking and expertise into the market;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;greater visibility for our senior experts and our best client work;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;marketing programmes, content and experiences that create meaningful conversations and support growth; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a faster, smarter and more measurable marketing operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to help shape not simply how Burson markets itself in the UK, but how the market sees Burson and what we are capable of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-CY1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Rubrik’s Sales organisation is a united group of elite cross-functional sales professionals that help companies &amp;amp; government entities achieve resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders, and operational disruptions. We offer continuous professional growth and opportunity through our world-class sales enablement program. Our One Rubrik selling approach provides all the resources you need to exceed your goals, maximize your earnings potential, and take your career to the next level. All this while doing something truly purposeful, protecting the world&#39;s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Large Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Large Enterprise Account Executive, you will have ownership of all elements of bookings growth in new and existing accounts across the UK region. We are seeking a relentless self-starter who is hyper-focused on acquiring new logos by discovering and developing new opportunities, managing pipeline, and executing account strategies, while also encouraging existing customer expansion. The AE must drive pipeline generation daily while working with Sales Engineers, Sales Development, Channel Development, and Rubrik Channel Partners to exceed sales quotas.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute sales plans for the assigned territory to meet and exceed quota through prospecting, qualifying, managing, and closing sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage sales pipeline to move a large number of strategic transactions through the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close new opportunities for growth working with a mix of Enterprise/Strat accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present Rubrik, Inc. solutions within complex data centre design environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell and strategise with partners, distributors, and VAR’s to enable rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Rubrik, Inc. management with feedback about the local market opportunity and identification of new business opportunities and channel partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Experience You’ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years Tech sales experience (selling either IT Infrastructure, Security or SaaS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent track record landing net &quot;new logos&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of performance with consistent overachievement of quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and experience working with channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly driven, goal oriented &quot;get it done&quot; attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a complex solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the converged network and security cloud for the AI era.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As AI reshapes cybersecurity, enterprises face a dual challenge: unlocking AI’s potential while defending against AI-driven attacks. Cato addresses both through a unified, cloud-native platform, providing the visibility and context to prioritize risks and stop threats in real time across users, applications, data, and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join us as we scale: take on ambitious technological challenges and shape the next generation of enterprise security at a company trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;We are looking for an intelligent and highly driven Enterprise Sales Professional to join our France Sales Team. In this role, you will be responsible for selling Cato’s solutions to prospective and existing customers across an assigned territory in France. This is an opportunity to join a SASE Rocket Ship and to take part in making the Future of Cloud Security and SD-WAN Today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Building and maintaining a sales pipeline sufficient to achieve/exceed quota objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Proven ability to accurately forecast monthly and quarterly sales revenue, as well as, effectively run and manage all aspects of the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Developing your assigned territories and maintaining key relationships with existing and/or potential partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Conducting target account prospecting and sales calls/demos onsite and over the phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;5 to 10+ years of Field and Remote sales experience with consistent over-achievement of quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Prior experience selling Networking and/or Security solutions to C-Level and Technical Buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Track record of collaborating and demonstrated success in Sales Organisations that fostered teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Willingness to work very hard to make exceptional success happen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Experience in selling cloud based solutions - Advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Computer Science or Engineering degree or work experience -&amp;nbsp;Strong Advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;English and French language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JW1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are Datadog&#39;s in-house product experts. The Technical Solutions team enables Datadog&#39;s worldwide growth by educating potential clients and ensuring that existing customers are happy and successful. We share our technical and product expertise with customers via multi-channel technical support, demos, and presentations. You’ll be joining a team and company where you will be challenged, but also will immediately witness your contributions to Datadog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, develop, coach and mentor Premier Support Engineers who respond to client requests, reproduce and troubleshoot issues, and dive into Datadog’s 400+ integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the owner for your team’s accountability and performance - managing performance reviews, performance plans, and any employee relations issues for your direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support team senior leadership to oversee team projects and initiatives to improve productivity, process or procedure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams and customers on high-priority escalations and act as a resource to resolve escalations from team members as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about people management and/or mentorship with previous experience leading a team, including managing other managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, detail-attentive, and have a desire for continuous learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical thinker who defaults to a client-centric approach and uses data to make informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tinkerer with some programming experience and a basic knowledge of Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active contribution to open-source projects (code, bug reports, etc.) and the Engineering Community (Meetups, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-breed onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, able to join our Community Guilds and Inclusion Talks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;VP of Technical Marketing – PQShield&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Reports to: Chief Commercial Officer&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Location: [Remote / UK / US] ·You must have the right to work in one the above countries in order to be considered for the role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is looking for a VP of Technical Marketing to make PQShield the technology and the brand the industry thinks of first for post-quantum security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the commercial team&#39;s technical voice in the market. You&#39;ll build the solutions and partnerships that help our sales team grow the pipeline, develop the semiconductor ecosystem around our IP, and lead technical thought leadership with customers, partners, standards bodies, and industry analysts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since NIST published its first post-quantum cryptography (PQC) standards, which the PQShield team co-authored, semiconductor companies, OEMs, and system builders across automotive, defense, industrial IoT, networking, and enterprise face a hard and urgent transition. This role puts PQShield at the center of that transition — through the partners who build with our IP, the solutions customers deploy, and the industry relationships that shape how the market moves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior role for someone who combines a security IP background with deep industry relationships, and who knows how to turn both into revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build solutions that grow pipeline: Create reference solutions, joint offerings, and use-case packages that give sales clear, repeatable ways into accounts. Combine PQPlatform, PQPerform, PQCryptoLib, and PQMicroLib with partner technology into solutions customers can adopt quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop the semiconductor ecosystem: Build and manage relationships with semiconductor suppliers, foundries, EDA and IP partners, processor and security-subsystem providers, and design services firms. Make PQShield IP the default choice for PQC in their roadmaps, reference designs, and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive partnerships that create demand: Identify, structure, and launch technical partnerships that open new markets and channels. Own the technical case for each partnership and ensure it produces pipeline, not just announcements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technical thought leadership: Be the senior technical voice of the commercial team. Speak at industry conferences, brief analysts and press, author white papers and technical articles, and represent PQShield in standards and industry forums.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use industry relationships to build the brand: Leverage your network across semiconductors, security, and system OEMs to establish PQShield as the key technology and brand for post-quantum security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Arm the commercial team technically: Give sales, FAEs, and partners the technical narratives, architectures, competitive positioning, and solution content they need to win complex, multi-stakeholder deals with engineers, architects, and executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape the market narrative: Define how the industry thinks about the post-quantum transition, cryptographic agility, side-channel and fault-injection protection, and certification (FIPS 140-3, SESIP, Common Criteria, ISO 26262) — and where PQShield fits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technical launches: Plan and deliver the technical go-to-market for new products, certifications, reference designs, and partner integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring the market back in: Feed customer, partner, and competitive insight into product and engineering so our roadmap stays ahead of where the market is heading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the team: Hire and lead a technical marketing team as the role scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like in your first 12 months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will measure this role on the following deliverables:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reference designs: Deliver 2 PQShield reference designs on widely used MCUs or SoCs, built with silicon partners and used in active sales opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Semiconductor ecosystem: Sign 5 ecosystem partners, such as silicon vendors, EDA and IP partners, or design services firms, that include PQShield IP in their roadmaps, reference designs or platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joint roadmap meetings and OEM requirements: Run 10 joint roadmap meetings that bring together an OEM, its silicon supplier and PQShield, and secure 5 OEM letters or RFQs that ask silicon suppliers for PQC capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner-sourced pipeline: Create identifiable silicon pipeline from ecosystem partners and joint roadmap meetings, tagged as influenced in CRM, that contributes to the company goals of 3x pipeline coverage and 15 design wins in 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solutions: Launch 3 solution packages that combine PQShield products with partner technology for priority use cases, each with a reference architecture, a solution brief and a demo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thought leadership: Deliver 6 conference talks or analyst briefings and 4 technical white papers or articles, and represent PQShield in at least one standards or industry working group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Market insight: Deliver a quarterly report to product and engineering on partner, customer and competitive requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior technical marketing leader with a security IP background, a strong industry network, and a track record of turning partnerships and technical credibility into revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12+ years in semiconductor IP, security, or embedded technology, with at least 5 years in technical marketing, solutions, business development, or ecosystem leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A background in security IP — for example, hardware security modules, root of trust, secure enclaves, cryptographic accelerators, or embedded security software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established relationships across semiconductor suppliers, IP and EDA vendors, system OEMs, and the security industry that you can use to open doors and build PQShield&#39;s position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven record of building ecosystem programs and partnerships that measurably grew pipeline and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credibility as a technical thought leader: experience speaking at industry events, writing for technical audiences, and engaging analysts, press, and standards bodies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work in depth with cryptographers and engineers, and to explain complex security technology to engineers, architects, CISOs, CTOs, and business executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong commercial mindset: you measure success by pipeline, design wins, and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles in semiconductor or OEM markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable building in a fast-moving company where the market narrative is still being written.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong advantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience at Arm, or in the Arm ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of cryptography, post-quantum cryptography, side-channel and fault-injection countermeasures, or security certifications such as FIPS 140-3, SESIP, or Common Criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with functional safety standards such as ISO 26262, or with automotive, defense, or industrial IoT markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share options.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A remote first company. You will work from home most of the time, but will need to join us in the office for planning sessions and key meetings as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel for customer meetings and marketing events as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generous PTO and holiday package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Company contributions towards 401K/pension&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;…and other great benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value the security of our daily digital lives, and love solving hard problems - then we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Standort: Frankfurt, Düsseldorf, Berlin, München (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Practice Area&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Banking &amp;amp; Payments | Anstellungsart: Unbefristet&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestalte mit uns die Zukunft des Zahlungsverkehrs – von SEPA-Prozessen und ISO-20022-Nachrichten bis hin zu modernen, AI-gestützten Arbeitsweisen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als (Senior) Consultant* – SEPA Payments begleitest Du anspruchsvolle Beratungsprojekte im Zahlungsverkehr und unterstützt unsere Kunden entlang des gesamten Projektzyklus – von der Business Analyse und Fachkonzeption über das Testing bis hin zur Implementierung. Dabei bringst Du Deine Payments-Expertise ein und &lt;strong&gt;nutzt geeignete, freigegebene AI-Tools und AI-gestützte Workflows, um Analysen, Qualität und Produktivität zu verbessern – stets mit menschlicher Beurteilung und unter Berücksichtigung geltender Responsible-AI-Leitplanken.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mit zunehmender Projekterfahrung übernimmst Du mehr Verantwortung für Deine Themen bis hin zur Leitung von Teilprojekten und kleineren Projektteams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest anspruchsvolle Beratungsprojekte im Zahlungsverkehr von der Business Analyse und Fachkonzeption über das Testing bis hin zur engen Begleitung der Implementierung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest kundenorientiert und bringst Deine eigenen Erfahrungen sowie die Expertise Deiner Capco-Kolleg*innen wirkungsvoll in die Projektarbeit ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du analysierst fachliche Anforderungen und Payments-Prozesse und entwickelst gemeinsam mit unseren Kunden tragfähige Lösungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst zunehmend Verantwortung für Deine Themen bis hin zur Leitung von Teilprojekten und kleineren Projektteams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du nutzt freigegebene AI-Tools, Automatisierung und AI-gestützte Workflows dort, wo sie einen praktischen Mehrwert für Geschwindigkeit, Qualität oder Erkenntnisgewinn bieten, und stellst durch Review, menschliche Beurteilung und definierte Eskalationswege eine verantwortungsvolle Nutzung sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein großes Interesse an (SEPA-)Payments und möchtest Deine Kenntnisse in diesem hochaktuellen Themenfeld einbringen und weiter ausbauen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begriffe und Nachrichtenformate wie pain, pacs und camt sind Dir vertraut; idealerweise kennst Du zudem SEPA-Begriffe und -Prozesse wie SCL, STEP2, SCT, SDD, Clearing &amp;amp; Settlement und R-Transaktionen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest konstruktiv und kundenorientiert und verfügst über starke analytische und konzeptionelle Fähigkeiten sowie die Fähigkeit, Themen klar zu vertreten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse und bist bereit, abhängig vom Projekteinsatz im nationalen und internationalen Umfeld zu reisen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist offen dafür, freigegebene AI- und Automatisierungstools verantwortungsvoll in Deine tägliche Arbeit einzubinden, Ergebnisse kritisch zu prüfen und geltende Leitplanken, Review- und Eskalationsprozesse einzuhalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Von Vorteil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vertiefte Kenntnisse von ISO 20022 sowie relevanten SEPA-Nachrichtenformaten und -Prozessen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Clearing- und Settlement-Prozessen sowie R-Transaktionen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Übernahme von Verantwortung für Arbeitspakete, Teilprojekte oder kleinere Projektteams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste praktische Erfahrung mit AI-gestützten Workflows, Generativer AI oder Automatisierung im Beratungs-, Banking- oder Payments-Umfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeite an wirkungsvollen Projekten und Lösungen für führende Finanzinstitute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erlebe eine kollaborative, offene und unternehmerisch geprägte Beratungskultur mit flachen Hierarchien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nutze kontinuierliche Lern- und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten, Trainings und Zertifizierungen für Deine persönliche und fachliche Entwicklung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werde Teil eines Teams, das die Zukunft digitaler Finanzdienstleistungen aktiv mitgestaltet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestalte die digitale Transformation unserer Kunden im Finanzdienstleistungssektor mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir bieten Dir ein wettbewerbsfähiges, auf unsere Mitarbeitenden ausgerichtetes Benefits-Paket, das Dich in unterschiedlichen Bereichen Deines Berufs- und Privatlebens unterstützt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle und hybrides Arbeiten je nach Projekteinsatz möglich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding sowie Dein persönlicher Coach und Buddy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike-Leasing-Programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wahlweise Capco Benefits Card mit monatlicher Gutschrift i.H.v. 44 EUR. oder Wellhub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regelmäßige Gesundheitschecks sowie Mental-Health-Kurse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Der PME-Familienservice bietet Unterstützung für alle Lebenslagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliches Feedback und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten, z. B. über interne Trainings und Udemy Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Großartige Firmenevents und After-Work-Veranstaltungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unbefristeter Arbeitsvertrag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomie, flache Hierarchien, Hands-on-Mentalität und schnelle Entscheidungswege.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein dynamisches, wachstumsstarkes und internationales Umfeld mit zahlreichen Möglichkeiten, Dich und Deine Talente einzubringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inklusion bei Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir setzen uns dafür ein, unseren Recruiting-Prozess für alle Menschen zugänglich und unkompliziert zu gestalten. Wenn Du in einer Phase des Bewerbungsprozesses Anpassungen oder Unterstützung benötigst, lass es uns einfach wissen – wir helfen Dir gerne weiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir schätzen die individuellen Perspektiven und Beiträge jedes Menschen. Bei Capco sind wir überzeugt, dass Du am stärksten bist, wenn Du Du selbst sein kannst. Unsere #BeYourselfAtWork-Kultur fördert Individualität und Zusammenarbeit – eine Haltung, die unsere tägliche Zusammenarbeit mit unseren Kunden und untereinander prägt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Wichtig ist nur, dass wir zueinander passen (m/w/d) #beyourselfatwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standorte:&lt;/strong&gt; Frankfurt | Berlin | München (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | &lt;strong&gt;Art:&lt;/strong&gt; Festanstellung&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du möchtest die regulatorische Transformation führender Finanzinstitute aktiv mitgestalten? Dann werde Teil unseres Teams und bringe Deine Expertise im transaktionsbasierten Meldewesen in anspruchsvolle Beratungs- und Transformationsprojekte ein. Gemeinsam entwickeln wir nachhaltige Lösungen für die regulatorischen Herausforderungen von heute und morgen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als (Senior) Consultant* - Meldewesen / Regulatory Reporting berätst Du unsere Kunden bei der Analyse, Konzeption und Optimierung regulatorischer Meldeprozesse. Du übernimmst eine zentrale Rolle bei der Umsetzung regulatorischer Anforderungen und arbeitest eng mit Fachbereichen, Operations, IT sowie dem Management zusammen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beratung unserer Kunden bei der Analyse, Konzeption und Optimierung transaktionsbasierter regulatorischer Meldeprozesse (EMIR REFIT, MiFIR/MiFID II und SFTR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fachliche Bewertung regulatorischer Änderungen und Ableitung nachhaltiger Umsetzungsmaßnahmen für Prozesse, Datenhaushalte und Systemlandschaften&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung und Abstimmung von Fachkonzepten, Anforderungen sowie Zielprozessen in enger Zusammenarbeit mit Fachbereichen, Operations und IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei Transformations-, Implementierungs- und Optimierungsprojekten sowie Begleitung der Einführung und Weiterentwicklung von Meldewesenlösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung hoher Datenqualität durch Definition und Weiterentwicklung von Governance-, Kontroll- und Validierungsprozessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung im transaktionsbasierten regulatorischen Meldewesen im Banken- oder Kapitalmarktumfeld mit fundierten Kenntnissen in EMIR REFIT, MiFIR/MiFID II und SFTR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tiefes Verständnis des End-to-End-Meldeprozesses einschließlich Datenerfassung, Anreicherung, Validierung, Meldung, Fehlerbearbeitung und Abstimmung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Praktische Erfahrung mit Nasdaq AxiomSL sowie Regnology Abacus Transactions und deren fachlicher Konzeption oder Weiterentwicklung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in regulatorischen Transformations- oder Implementierungsprojekten sowie ausgeprägte Fähigkeit, komplexe regulatorische Sachverhalte adressatengerecht aufzubereiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Definition fachlicher Anforderungen für regulatorische Reporting-Lösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift sowie eine hohe Reisebereitschaft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse moderner Datenqualitäts- und Governance-Frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im Stakeholder-Management auf Management- und Projektleitungsebene&lt;/li&gt;
