&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Firmus, we are committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace. We encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds who are passionate about creating a more sustainable future through innovative engineering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to revolutionise the AI industry through sustainable practices and cutting-edge engineering. Apply now to be part of shaping the future of sustainable AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

