an&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt;showcases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt; the innovation behind over 550 patents in AI-driven generative design, materials, and additive manufacturing. With our three core pillars of dominating performance, iconic design, and revolutionary technology, Czinger is at the intersection of deep technology, consumer products, and high-performance branding. We invite you to join our world-class talent in shaping the future of the automotive industry. Here, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt;you&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot;&gt; be part of a groundbreaking journey that pushes the limits of performance, design, technology, and sustainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP TrackedChange CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRestV2 PointComment CommentHighlightRest SCXW144108776 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Purpose&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Quality Engineer is responsible for driving quality performance across the assigned products and supplier base throughout the full product lifecycle, from supplier development and production readiness through launch, current production and issue resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The primary responsibility for this role is the Chassis vehicle system, with additional execution support for selected Powertrain suppliers and activities within the UK, including the Powertrain Controls interface. The role requires a high level of ownership, practical judgement and technical understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective cross functional collaboration to identify quality risks early, develop effective solutions and ensure robust implementation. Working closely with Engineering, Manufacturing, Supply Chain and suppliers, the Senior Quality Engineer will take ownership of quality concerns, drive supplier performance and support the continuous improvement of Quality Engineering processes, standards and practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supplier Development &amp;amp; Production Readiness&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support supplier selection by assessing manufacturing capability, process maturity and identify key quality risks and required actions before supplier nomination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply the Supplier Qualification Framework and lead or coordinate the appropriate APQP, PPAP, audit and production-readiness activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review key manufacturing controls, including FMEAs, Control Plans, inspection strategy, process capability and validation evidence, challenging gaps and driving actions where controls are not adequate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive supplier-development actions and ensure significant supplier or manufacturing changes receive appropriate validation and requalification before implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supplier Execution &amp;amp; Current Quality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Quality Engineering follow-up for assigned suppliers and components &amp;nbsp;after launch, monitoring performance and emerging risks, proactively driving improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead containment, root-cause analysis and corrective action for significant supplier-related concerns, verifying sustainable prevention of recurrence, including clear ownership, timing and evidence of effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine when supplier visits, additional controls, escalation or supplier-development activities are required, using risk and data to determine the appropriate level of response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and coordinate incoming inspection requirements for assigned parts when defined by the Supplier Qualification Framework or required as part of issue containment, including stock checks, increased inspection and verification of subsequent purchase orders until confidence in product quality is restored.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide local UK execution support for selected Powertrain suppliers while maintaining alignment with the Powertrain system owner and relevant Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Product Quality &amp;amp; Ticket Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and coordinate the Product-quality ticket landscape for the assigned vehicle system, including Issues, Enhancements, FAR’s (Field Action Requests) and other applicable concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure concerns are clearly defined, prioritised and progressed with appropriate containment, technical ownership and corrective action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate resolution across Engineering, Manufacturing, Supply Chain and suppliers, clearly escalating significant or ageing risks when progress is insufficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain alignment between supplier-level actions and Product-level resolution, including support to Powertrain activities when assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Quality Documentation &amp;amp; Standards&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development, implementation and continuous improvement of Quality Engineering standards and documentation, using lessons learned from practical supplier and product quality experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure applicable requirements are understood and consistently deployed internally and within the supplier base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture lessons learned from supplier and Product-quality concerns into standards covering areas such as qualification, APQP/PPAP, inspection, critical characteristics, supplier changes and structured problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote effective and proportionate quality controls without unnecessary complexity or bureaucracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and a track record of taking complex issues through to effective closure, with the ability to work independently and make sound decisions in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience in Quality Engineering, Supplier Quality, Manufacturing Engineering or a related technical environment, ideally within a high-complexity manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with suppliers and manufacturing processes, with sound structured problem-solving capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of APQP, PPAP, FMEA, Control Plans and production-process qualification, with the ability to apply these tools practically and proportionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand engineering drawings, specifications and technical requirements, and translate them into practical quality controls. Previous GD&amp;amp;T experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working cross-functionally and constructively challenging suppliers or internal stakeholders when required, whilst maintaining effective working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise in a fast-moving environment, combining a practical, data-driven approach with sound judgement, and focus effort on the highest quality risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, curiosity and willingness to develop a detailed understanding of the product and manufacturing process, with the ability to communicate technical quality risks clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within automotive, motorsport, aerospace or other high-complexity manufacturing environments is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chassis or Powertrain experience is advantageous but not essential where strong transferable technical capability can be demonstrated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with low-volume, high value, high performance and technically complex products is particularly relevant to the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Work Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£71,971&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£98,963 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer Our Regular, Full-Time Employees:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Compensation Package: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a world-class compensation package that includes a competitive salary, equity plan, and discretionary results-based incentive bonus opportunities, ensuring you&#39;re truly valued for your contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness and Time Off: &lt;/strong&gt;Embrace a healthy lifestyle with paid vacation, sick time, and company holidays, including a year-end shutdown to recharge. We support growing families with paid parental leave, recognizing the importance of bonding time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Health and Wellness: &lt;/strong&gt;Prioritize your well-being with our comprehensive health and wellness benefits, offering both HMO and Premium PPO options. Additionally, benefit from company-sponsored life insurance and short and long-term disability coverage for peace of mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment in Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re committed to your professional development. Take advantage of reimbursement opportunities for learning and development initiatives, empowering you to continuously expand your skill set and reach peak performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative and High-Performing Environment: &lt;/strong&gt;Join our collaborative, dynamic, and high-performing team within a fast-paced, mission-driven company. Together, we&#39;re disrupting the traditional manufacturing industry, fostering innovation, and integrating people and technology to reduce our footprint.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;CZV, Inc. is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability or veteran status, or any other applicable state or federal protected characteristic. CZV, Inc. provides affirmative action in employment for qualified Individuals with Disabilities and Protected Veterans in compliance with Section 503 of the Rehabilitation Act and the Vietnam Era Veterans’ Readjustment Assistance Act..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;EEO Poster&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In order to adjust to changes in our business, it may become necessary to add, remove or modify certain duties and responsibilities, or to reassign you to another job position. From time to time you may be asked to work on special projects or to assist with other work. Your cooperation and assistance in performing such additional work is expected.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;E-Verify: Right to Work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our company participates in &lt;a href=&quot;https://e-verify.uscis.gov/web/media/resourcesContents/E-Verify_Participation_Poster_ES.pdf&quot;&gt;E-Verify&lt;/a&gt;. E-Verify is a program that electronically confirms a candidate’s eligibility to work in the United States after completing the Employment Eligibility Verification (Form I-9). The information provided on the Form I-9 is compared to the records contained in the Social Security Administration and Department of Homeland Security (DHS) databases. This helps employers verify the identity and employment eligibility of newly hired employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/IER_RightToWorkPoster.pdf&quot;&gt;Eligibility to Work Poster (English)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/IER_RighttoWorkPosterES.pdf&quot;&gt;Eligibility to Work Poster (Spanish)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance (FCIHO)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pursuant to the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance (FCIHO), we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;No agencies, no solicitations, and no calls please.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://clearstreet.io/&quot;&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Software Engineer on Clear Street’s Payments team, you’ll play a key role in scaling and modernising our rapidly evolving global payments infrastructure. You’ll develop highly reliable, API-driven systems that integrate seamlessly with external banks and payment gateways, streamlining complex operational workflows and supporting our expansion into new lines of business, including digital initiatives. Working closely with cross-functional partners, you’ll contribute to large-scale, high-impact initiatives that enhance our core payments offering, significantly reduce manual operational processes, and offer our customers a smooth payment experience, helping to shape the future of the Clear Street financial ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Engineer highly reliable, API-driven payment systems that streamline operations and support our global expansion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Translate product and design requirements into clean, maintainable and well-tested components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, business, operations, designers and back-end engineers to deliver high-quality experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and resolve performance, accessibility, and usability issues across the application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews, contribute to shared component libraries, and help uphold our engineering standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support the operational health of your features and help maintain a high SLA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work with a team of talented, passionate and highly collaborative engineers. Working together, we have built a platform that serves institutional clients and is at the forefront of technological innovation. Our engineers take pride in not just the value we provide our customers but the quality of our work. You will have the opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies, collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds, and make a meaningful impact on the financial industry. We value creativity, innovation, strong work ethics, and we are committed to providing our team members with the support and resources they need to succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Java Spring Boot, Kafka, gRPC/REST, Kubernetes and Cloud (AWS or Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Master Java and Spring Boot, and comfortably make tweaks in TypeScript/React, Go, and Python.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A proven track record of driving technical decisions and owning complex, large-scale engineering problems end-to-end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building scalable architectures utilizing Kafka and Kubernetes for robust, resilient integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of global payment ecosystems, external banking APIs, and streamlining complex operational workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong command of software design patterns, distributed systems, clean code principles, and automated testing strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to actively manage technical debt, negotiate requirements, and ship reliable solutions without demanding perfection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Actively advocate for better tooling, overhaul inefficient processes, and push our engineering practices forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A highly collaborative mindset with a preference for collectively solving intricate architectural challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&quot;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? Apply anyway! We are looking for strong engineers with a growth mindset, not perfect resumes. If this role excites you, we want to hear from you.&quot;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender-neutral parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a business when we are all together in person. As such, we require employees to be in the office a minimum of three days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We help each other through challenges and celebrate each other’s successes. We believe that modern workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse in ideas, in cultures, and in experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://clearstreet.io/&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://clearstreet.io&quot;&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a Software Engineer (Front-End), you will help build our flagship Clear Street Studio, a modern prime brokerage experience. You will tackle non-trivial problems that force you to balance trade-offs while implementing clean and efficient solutions. You will raise our bar on delivering solutions that delight and offer the best experience for our customers, and you will push our operational standards to ensure we can offer and maintain a high SLA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is deeply involved in engineering the next generation of our state-of-the-art Studio (portal) for a varied client base including hedge funds, traders, and portfolio managers. As a senior member of the team, you will set technical direction, mentor other engineers, and own significant parts of the platform end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;• Design and deliver complex, user-facing features and shared foundations for Clear Street Studio.&lt;br&gt;• Drive a system-design approach to building new front-end services, balancing trade-offs across scale, performance, and maintainability.&lt;br&gt;• Set and evolve engineering standards across the Studio Core team, including architecture, testing, tooling, and code quality.&lt;br&gt;• Mentor and grow other engineers through code review, pairing, and technical guidance.&lt;br&gt;• Collaborate with product, design, and back-end leads to shape roadmaps and turn ambiguous problems into clear technical plans.&lt;br&gt;• Own the operational excellence of your domains, ensuring reliability, observability, and a high SLA.&lt;br&gt;• Clearly explain the nuances of system design and front-end paradigms to engineers and stakeholders alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You will join the Studio Core front-end team, a group of talented, passionate and highly collaborative engineers who own the foundations of the Clear Street Studio experience. Working together, we have built a platform that serves institutional clients and is at the forefront of technological innovation. Our engineers take pride not just in the value we provide our customers, but in the quality of our work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of our team, you will work with cutting-edge technologies, collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds, and make a meaningful impact on the financial industry. We value creativity, innovation, and a strong work ethic, and we are committed to providing our team members with the support and resources they need to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;React, TypeScript, Next.js, Module Federation, Nx, Node.js, Kubernetes, and Cloud (AWS or Azure).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;• At least three (3) years of professional experience implementing scalable web applications with React and TypeScript.&lt;br&gt;• Experience contributing to systems that solve complex business problems and handle massive amounts of data; you are drawn towards scale, distributed systems, and associated technologies.&lt;br&gt;• A strong command of design patterns, data structures, and algorithms.&lt;br&gt;• The ability to clearly explain the nuances of system design and paradigms to engineers and stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;• A track record of prioritizing end-user experience, reflected in your API design, functionality, and performance.&lt;br&gt;• Demonstrated ability to mentor team members, define engineering standards, and drive a system- design approach to building new services.&lt;br&gt;• Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with a consistent focus on delivering high-quality products.&lt;br&gt;• Pride in the quality of your work and a high standard for what you ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;• Experience leading front-end architecture for large-scale or data-intensive applications.&lt;br&gt;• Deep experience with monorepo tooling (Nx, Turborepo) and micro-frontend architectures such as Module Federation.&lt;br&gt;• Hands-on experience with Kubernetes, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms (AWS or Azure).&lt;br&gt;• Experience in financial services, capital markets, or trading platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender-neutral parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a business when we are all together in person. As such, we require employees to be in the office a minimum of three days per week. Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We help each other through challenges and celebrate each other’s successes. We believe that modern workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse in ideas, in cultures, and in experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://clearstreet.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://clearstreet.io&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1766166763873000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3GfALVHjsW8XaQSab-3CbX&quot;&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Site Reliability Engineer (SRE)&amp;nbsp; you sit at the intersection of software reliability and operational &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;excellence. You own the health, resilience, and recovery of our production systems—while &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;spending equal energy innovating solutions that eliminate human toil, reduce incident blast &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;radius, and raise the reliability bar across the entire platform.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will partner closely with engineering, operations, and business teams to understand daily &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;pain points and translate them into lasting automated solutions. Half your time is spent in the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;trenches—supporting production, responding to incidents, and deeply understanding how our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;systems behave under real conditions. The other half is yours to build: automation, tooling, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;observability platforms that make tomorrow&amp;amp;#39;s on-call shift meaningfully easier than today&#39;s.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work on challenges like:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Design and build comprehensive monitoring and observability platforms that surface the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;right signal at the right time—eliminating alert fatigue and accelerating root-cause &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Develop intelligent automation and self-healing capabilities that diagnose issues, trigger &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;recovery workflows, and reduce mean time to recovery (MTTR) without manual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;intervention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Analyze incidents, identify systemic trends, and engineer solutions that prevent entire &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;classes of failures from recurring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Build reusable runbooks, diagnostic tooling, and recovery playbooks that turn tribal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;knowledge into scalable platform capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Create golden-path operational workflows—making the safest, most reliable path also &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;the easiest one for engineering teams to follow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Partner with Platform Engineering to influence CI/CD pipelines, deployment safety, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;infrastructure resilience from a production reliability perspective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Champion Infrastructure as Code, GitOps, and SRE best practices while helping teams &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;adopt modern engineering workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Continuously measure production health through SLIs/SLOs/SLAs, and drive &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;engineering priorities based on reliability data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Explore emerging technologies—including AI-assisted diagnostics and developer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;tooling—that transform how we operate production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We believe resilient systems are built by engineers who understand them end to end.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our Production Engineering team is the first and last line of defense for our production platform.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We treat reliability as a product, with uptime and engineer experience as our north stars. We &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;combine the discipline of SRE with a builder&#39;s mindset: when we see a recurring problem, we &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;build a solution—not a workaround.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work across every engineering and operations team to understand failure modes, quantify &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;reliability gaps, and build platform capabilities that scale with the organization. Whether it&#39;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;reducing MTTR from hours to minutes, building self-service diagnostic tools, or designing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;proactive alerting that catches issues before customers notice, your work will have immediate, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;measurable impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about making production systems invisible to end users—and you get &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;energy from both firefighting and building the systems that make fires less likely—you&#39;ll thrive &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who combine operational instinct with a builder&#39;s discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You should have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Strong hands-on Python skills—this is your primary language for automation and tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Experience in SRE, Production Engineering, Platform Engineering, or a related discipline &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;with direct production ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Proven track record of building automation and diagnostic tooling that improved recovery &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;times or reduced operational toil.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Deep familiarity with cloud-native technologies—Kubernetes, containers, distributed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;systems—and how they fail in production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Experience with observability platforms such as Datadog, and a strong intuition for what &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;good&quot; monitoring looks like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Exposure to Infrastructure as Code (Terraform) and GitOps-based deployment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;workflows (ArgoCD, GitHub Actions, or similar).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Familiarity with the broader technology stack: Java, Go, Kafka, Redis, Snowflake, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Postgres.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Strong analytical and problem-solving skills—you thrive on ambiguous, high-stakes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;production problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● A product mindset applied to operational tooling: you think about usability, adoption, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;documentation when building internal solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Excellent communication skills and the ability to work fluidly across engineering, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;operations, and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Self-starter mentality—you identify opportunities, take initiative, and deliver with minimal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;supervision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Curiosity and a continuous learning mindset; fintech or financial industry background is a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Technology You&#39;ll Work With&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll operate and build on a modern cloud-native platform that includes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Kubernetes &amp;amp; AWS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Terraform &amp;amp; ArgoCD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● GitHub Actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Kafka, Redis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● PostgreSQL &amp;amp; Snowflake&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Datadog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Python, Go, Java&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● gRPC &amp;amp; Protobuf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Internal Platform APIs and Developer Tooling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Within your first year, you&#39;ll have made a measurable impact on production reliability. Success l&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ooks like:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Reducing mean time to detection (MTTD) and mean time to recovery (MTTR) across key &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Building automation that handles a meaningful percentage of incident scenarios without &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;human intervention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Becoming a trusted subject matter expert for core platform components and their failure &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;modes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Delivering observability and diagnostic tools that other engineers actually use and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;depend on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Establishing SLO baselines and driving engineering investment based on reliability data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;● Spending less of your time—and your teammates time—on repetitive manual toil.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your impact won&#39;t be measured by the number of incidents you respond to—it will be measured &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;by how reliably our systems run and how quickly we recover when they don&#39;t.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://clearstreet.io/&quot;&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on Clear Street’s futures and options execution services team, you’ll play a key role in designing and building the next generation of our Clear Street futures and options EMS platform from the ground up.&amp;nbsp; You’ll develop a high-performance platform that brings together real-time market data, low latency exchange connectivity and execution, robust risk controls, and advanced trading capabilities within a fast, responsive web interface.&amp;nbsp; Working closely with cross-functional partners, you’ll contribute to large-scale, high impact initiatives that enhance our prime brokerage offering and help shape the future of the Clear Street trading experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will be building a brand new EMS platform for Listed Futures and Options.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Translate product and design requirements into clean, maintainable and well-tested components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, business, traders, designers and back-end engineers to deliver high-quality experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and resolve performance, accessibility, and usability issues across the application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews, contribute to shared component libraries, and help uphold our engineering standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support the operational health of your features and help maintain a high SLA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work with a team of talented, passionate and highly collaborative engineers. Working together, we have built a platform that serves institutional clients and is at the forefront of technological innovation. Our engineers take pride in not just the value we provide our customers but the quality of our work. You will have the opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies, collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds, and make a meaningful impact on the financial industry. We value creativity, innovation, strong work ethics, and we are committed to providing our team members with the support and resources they need to succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Java and/or Rust, AWS, FIX protocol, Kafka ,&amp;nbsp; Kubernetes and Cloud (AWS or Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering experience using Java.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At least 4 years of experience working with modern technologies, including a proven track record operating at Senior Engineer level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building and supporting low-latency, front-office trading systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of execution management systems (EMS), including their core functionality and workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of software design patterns, data structures, and algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative mindset and a preference for working in team-oriented environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A strong commitment to engineering quality, reliability, and high development standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for delivering a best-in-class developer experience, with a focus on tooling, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender-neutral parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a business when we are all together in person. As such, we require employees to be in the office a minimum of three days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We help each other through challenges and celebrate each other’s successes. We believe that modern workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse in ideas, in cultures, and in experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

