&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;📍London or UK remote | 💰 £100,000 to £130,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/#benefits&quot;&gt; Benefits &lt;/a&gt;|&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/technology&quot;&gt; Technology&lt;/a&gt; -&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/data&quot;&gt; Data&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qv2ufb&quot; data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;373&quot;&gt;⭐ About Data at Monzo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;632&quot;&gt;Data is at the heart of how we make decisions and build products at Monzo. Our Data teams bring together Data Science, Analytics Engineering, Data Analytics and Machine Learning, working closely with Product, Engineering and other teams across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;634&quot; data-end=&quot;928&quot;&gt;Our Data Scientists are embedded within product and business areas across Monzo, where they use experimentation, causal inference, statistical modelling, machine learning and analytics to understand our customers, identify opportunities and influence the direction of our products and strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;Data Science Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll lead a team of Data Scientists and other Data professionals within one of these areas, combining people leadership with strategic data leadership and close partnership with senior stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ylxzul&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;🔑 You&#39;ll play a key role by...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1372&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with Product, Engineering and senior leaders to ensure data plays a central role in how we understand problems, make decisions and develop our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1731&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll lead and develop a team of talented Data Scientists, helping them do their best work while setting a high bar for analytical quality and impact. You&#39;ll provide strategic direction across complex problems, help teams identify where Data Science can have the greatest impact, and ensure insights translate into meaningful decisions and product changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;2102&quot;&gt;We have a strong culture of data-driven decision making across Monzo. We&#39;re big believers in powerful, accessible analytics and empowering teams across the business to answer questions themselves. Around 90% of our day-to-day data-driven decisions are supported by self-serve analytics through Looker, giving our Data teams the space to focus on higher-impact problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;18uh40c&quot; data-start=&quot;2104&quot; data-end=&quot;2123&quot;&gt;Your day-to-day&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;3199&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p4mj4y&quot; data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot;&gt;Lead, develop and grow a team of exceptional Data Scientists and other Data professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kl695j&quot; data-start=&quot;2218&quot; data-end=&quot;2335&quot;&gt;Hire, coach and retain talented people while creating an environment where they can develop and do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wu0fsg&quot; data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2458&quot;&gt;Set the Data Science direction for your area and identify where data can have the greatest customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ohaplb&quot; data-start=&quot;2459&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering and senior stakeholders to shape strategy and influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lt3n4x&quot; data-start=&quot;2570&quot; data-end=&quot;2692&quot;&gt;Bring analytical rigour to complex and ambiguous problems and help teams turn them into clear, actionable opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;62gosu&quot; data-start=&quot;2693&quot; data-end=&quot;2847&quot;&gt;Ensure teams are using the right analytical approaches, from experimentation and causal inference through to statistical modelling and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;spek0d&quot; data-start=&quot;2848&quot; data-end=&quot;2937&quot;&gt;Help connect Data Science work to measurable customer, product and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7im1pb&quot; data-start=&quot;2938&quot; data-end=&quot;3085&quot;&gt;Work with Analytics Engineering, Machine Learning and other Data disciplines to ensure teams have the data, tooling and infrastructure they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1302yjf&quot; data-start=&quot;3086&quot; data-end=&quot;3199&quot;&gt;Contribute to the wider Data Science discipline at Monzo, helping us continually raise the bar for how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ycs329&quot; data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;🤩 We&#39;d love to hear from you if...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3242&quot; data-end=&quot;4399&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n0jdqo&quot; data-start=&quot;3242&quot; data-end=&quot;3282&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re doing at Monzo excites you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aaanm1&quot; data-start=&quot;3283&quot; data-end=&quot;3357&quot;&gt;You have significant experience managing and developing Data Scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jatyaf&quot; data-start=&quot;3358&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;You&#39;re a strong strategic data leader who uses data to influence decisions and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ai3t3h&quot; data-start=&quot;3450&quot; data-end=&quot;3573&quot;&gt;You have experience partnering with senior and executive stakeholders across different functions and levels of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qxq852&quot; data-start=&quot;3574&quot; data-end=&quot;3660&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable working autonomously in a fast-growing and evolving organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vwfjmo&quot; data-start=&quot;3661&quot; data-end=&quot;3809&quot;&gt;You have a strong understanding of Data Science approaches including experimentation, causal inference, statistical analysis and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r6z2hr&quot; data-start=&quot;3810&quot; data-end=&quot;3953&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with tools and languages such as Python and SQL, and understand how to choose the right analytical approach for a problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1195ki8&quot; data-start=&quot;3954&quot; data-end=&quot;4079&quot;&gt;You can build credibility with Product, Engineering and senior business leaders and influence without relying on authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w97j5z&quot; data-start=&quot;4080&quot; data-end=&quot;4192&quot;&gt;You have strong product judgement and experience using Data Science to shape product development and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nmurw1&quot; data-start=&quot;4193&quot; data-end=&quot;4291&quot;&gt;You know how to balance technical excellence with pragmatic decision-making and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qvls2w&quot; data-start=&quot;4292&quot; data-end=&quot;4399&quot;&gt;You have experience helping Data Scientists develop their technical, product and leadership capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;br6dct&quot; data-start=&quot;4401&quot; data-end=&quot;4426&quot;&gt;The interview process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4428&quot; data-end=&quot;4537&quot;&gt;Our interview process involves 3 main stages. We promise not to ask you any brain teasers or trick questions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4539&quot; data-end=&quot;4657&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o6cctv&quot; data-start=&quot;4539&quot; data-end=&quot;4565&quot;&gt;30-minute recruiter call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;todk6r&quot; data-start=&quot;4566&quot; data-end=&quot;4606&quot;&gt;45-minute call with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hpj58m&quot; data-start=&quot;4607&quot; data-end=&quot;4657&quot;&gt;3 x 1-hour video calls with various team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4659&quot; data-end=&quot;4844&quot;&gt;Our average process takes around 3–4 weeks, but we&#39;ll always work around your availability. You&#39;ll have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1p19p2y&quot; data-start=&quot;4846&quot; data-end=&quot;4870&quot;&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4872&quot; data-end=&quot;4909&quot;&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4911&quot; data-end=&quot;4933&quot;&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4935&quot; data-end=&quot;5067&quot;&gt;📍 This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK, with ad hoc meetings in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5069&quot; data-end=&quot;5196&quot;&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5198&quot; data-end=&quot;5277&quot;&gt;📚 Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-LG1 #LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Functions:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Capability to apply abstract reuse patterns to integrations and code both on platform and elsewhere using one or more nCino supported languages&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to manipulate how Salesforce leverages, utilizes, and generates nCino supported languages&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide technical assistance and leadership for medium to large financial institutions and Implementation Service Consultants when building integrations into the nCino/Force.com platform using the nCino Integration Framework.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Begin to co-lead integrations from third-party systems into the nCino platform using any number of technical solutions based on the desired and proper approach for each unique project.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Document process and procedure to help streamline integration methodology.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build and document testing requirements for unique projects.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide solution and integration development with Salesforce.com including requirements, functional specs, design, custom development, integration, testing and deployment.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Evaluate vendor API and interface specifications.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Handle multiple projects effectively while continuing to deliver exceptional quality.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Work independently and prioritize time and projects appropriately.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Translate customer requirements into implementation plans.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive customer success with a team player attitude.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Design a salesforce solution that meets the needs of the customer.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Effectively track time and bill for hours worked on customer projects.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Assist sales and sales engineering on technical prospect calls when required.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Leverage AI/ML capabilities to enhance integration frameworks, solution design, system automation, and operational efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Support the responsible use of AI-driven approaches in cloud-based solutions, DevOps practices, and Salesforce architecture to drive customer success and innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stay informed on emerging AI technologies and assist the team in identifying opportunities for scalable and secure AI integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Typically requires a minimum of 8 years of related experience/ proficiency with a bachelor’s degree; or 6 years and a Master’s / Advanced degree; or equivalent work experience (as applicable). Some barriers to entry exist at this level, requiring department review.&#39;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to design, build, articulate and defend architectural designs, primarily around integrations, but including some basic UI components and designs&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to support a dev ops process and build solutions with various software development practices&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Able to apply engineering principles to code, flow, and integration patterns including on and off platform tools&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to document more complex solutions and customer facing documentation for work performed&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Salesforce Dev401 certification&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong research, analytical and creative problem-solving skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Advanced knowledge of data management, SQL and RDBMS technologies.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience using ETL/integration platforms&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Financial Services experience.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience with Salesforce.com developer toolkit IDE, Migration Tool, Web Services.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Exposure to Salesforce.com configuration and custom development.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent understanding of object-oriented concepts and design patterns, as well as prior work with object-oriented languages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Large FI experience, particularly with the Loan Origination/Servicing Systems, Enterprise Architecture framework&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Informatica experience.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience with Apex, SOQL, XML, JavaScript.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Salesforce System Architect.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Object-oriented languages such as Java, Ruby, C#, C++.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ETL/integration platforms such as Cast Iron, Informatica, SnapLogic, etc.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong presentation and communication skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong customer and professional skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position may require some travel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£71,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£120,900 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;nCino is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, nCino will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and equality includes a strong belief that the diversity of our team is instrumental to our success.&amp;nbsp; We strive to create workplaces where employees are empowered to bring their authentic selves to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ncino.com/ncino-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;Please view our Applicant Privacy Policy here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Functions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideate - Own the roadmap. Identify next highest priority problems to solve. Influence the company towards a strategic direction based on your knowledge and expertise&lt;br&gt;Validate the roadmap with customers. Take output from junior product team members&#39; research to advance the planning&lt;br&gt;Plan - Represent Product vision and VOC for your feature/feature set in planning sessions with Design and Architecture/Eng. Be knowledgeable enough to challenge the approach and ensure the best approach is being pursued&lt;br&gt;Build - Be involved in key milestones. Major stakeholder in sprint reviews and weekly demos&lt;br&gt;Launch - Lead customer-facing Early Adopter conversations. Develop strategic launch plan with cross-functional team&lt;br&gt;Grow - Help junior product team members&#39; interpret success metrics, work with customer awareness&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;nCino Product Knowledge - As the owner of your feature/feature set you should be able to lead conversations with customers in all segments about the value of your feature(s) in how they solve business problems as well as the vision and roadmap for the overall experience this feature connects to and how that will further add value to our customers. This will include objection handling through your deep knowledge of how other customers use the feature or have adjusted their business process to gain value. You understand how and why our solution is best-in-class (or how is measures up to competitors)&lt;br&gt;Leverage AI and machine learning capabilities to enhance product decision-making, identify customer behavior patterns, forecast trends, and uncover unmet needs.&lt;br&gt;Apply AI-powered analytics to validate product assumptions, track adoption, and surface opportunities for improvement.&lt;br&gt;Collaborate with engineering to explore and integrate AI/ML features that add value to the customer experience while staying informed on emerging technologies and their potential application across the product lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, Finance,&amp;nbsp;Computer&amp;nbsp;Science&lt;u&gt;,&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;or a related field with 8+ years of related experience/proficiency&amp;nbsp;or a combination of education and experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in presenting to multiple layers of a company, including executives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of software development processes, technologies, and methodologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience being involved in the sales cycle and conducting customer interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding written and oral communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to plan and deliver products in an agile environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrable ability to gather and transform product feedback into actionable requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with loan origination software/technology and&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and commercial onboarding, CLM, or KYB/KYC compliance technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with EMEA regulatory landscape (UK MLR, AMLR 2027)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel Requirements - &amp;lt;10%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Advanced knowledge of Agile principles&lt;br&gt;Advanced knowledge of the commercial, small business banking, treasury, consumer space in relation to both processes and regulations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£71,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£120,900 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
