&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with developers and product teams to develop a suitable testing strategy for our backend systems and ensure sensible test coverage across different testing levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design, implement, and maintain automated tests for our APIs and microservices, ensuring that our test automation remains stable and maintainable as complexity grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You decide which tests make sense at the unit, API/integration, or end-to-end level, and help avoid duplication between testing levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You integrate automated tests into our CI/CD pipelines, analyze test results, and help identify errors and quality risks early in the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You analyze and debug failed and unstable tests, and continuously improve existing test frameworks and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actively contribute to our quality engineering efforts, identify quality risks with the team, and decide where test automation adds real value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work closely with developers, product owners, business teams, and other QA engineers, making quality a shared part of product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
